(2282366, 315651, 49858, '<td valign="top">It looks like this picture was lit by daylight from a window from behind the rose, which has placed the rose in the shadow.  Not very easy to do when photographing close to a window, but the lighting would have been better if the picture was taken from the other side, with the window behind you.  Try moving further into the room.  In my opinion a sheet of coloured card would have made a better background.</td>', 'It looks like this picture was lit by daylight from a window from behind the rose, which has placed the rose in the shadow.  Not very easy to do when photographing close to a window, but the lighting would have been better if the picture was taken from the other side, with the window behind you.  Try moving further into the room.  In my opinion a sheet of coloured card would have made a better background.', '2006-04-03 02:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
