(2282477, 315027, 43463, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and the lighting is very complementary to the subject. A bare shoulder and the soft lighted profile of the lower half of a woman''s face is seen. The yellow flower is beautiful and poised close to this woman''s nose. The sense of smell is strong as the viewer drinks in the scent of the flower as they look upon the imagery within this capture. I love the addition of the straw hat with that soft pale yellow band - it really brings to mind some impressionist paintings of which capture woman standing in an open meadow sporting lovely hats. That yellow on the band of the hat nicely complements the yellow of the flower, but without being so vibrant such that it steals the limelight of the focal point subject of the yellow flower. Very well done.</td>', 'Lovely composition and the lighting is very complementary to the subject. A bare shoulder and the soft lighted profile of the lower half of a woman''s face is seen. The yellow flower is beautiful and poised close to this woman''s nose. The sense of smell is strong as the viewer drinks in the scent of the flower as they look upon the imagery within this capture. I love the addition of the straw hat with that soft pale yellow band - it really brings to mind some impressionist paintings of which capture woman standing in an open meadow sporting lovely hats. That yellow on the band of the hat nicely complements the yellow of the flower, but without being so vibrant such that it steals the limelight of the focal point subject of the yellow flower. Very well done.', '2006-04-03 03:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
