(2283042, 313643, 33560, '<td valign="top">This is very unique and lovely subject.  As is true for many flowers there is a kind of mathematical elegance to the organization of the elements, but it''s a highly unusual one.  I love the pale, soft treatment given the subject and the generally soft contrast, but I kind of wish I could see a little more of the lovely structure of the flower.</td>', 'This is very unique and lovely subject.  As is true for many flowers there is a kind of mathematical elegance to the organization of the elements, but it''s a highly unusual one.  I love the pale, soft treatment given the subject and the generally soft contrast, but I kind of wish I could see a little more of the lovely structure of the flower.', '2006-04-03 08:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
