(2283233, 315769, 50056, '<td valign="top">LOL...great title, great shot</td>', 'LOL...great title, great shot', '2006-04-03 10:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283235, 314913, 35545, '<td valign="top">On my monitor, there''s too much black.  The sunrise is coming across as green, not golden.</td>', 'On my monitor, there''s too much black.  The sunrise is coming across as green, not golden.', '2006-04-03 10:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283238, 313616, 43463, '<td valign="top">The model has the poise and look to certainly invoke the idea of Roxie from Chicago, but the composition needs some improvement. First their are some rosy tones present in the skin but they are getting slightly washed out her and there and I think an exposure that is less ''overexposed'' would help not only bring out the rich rosy tones in skin color but also in overall hue of the colors present. For the composition you really wanted the yellow/blonde hues of the hair &amp; the straps to the top/dress to really ''pop'' for the Yellow Challenge. As it stands here those rich, bold or vibrant hues are missing - they are too washed out. The color that really pops is those red lips. The red lipstick really calls attention to itself and is the hue that is most vibrant, bold and eye-catching. Not what you wanted because it robs attention away from the yellow hues you wish to be front &amp; center in this composition. The white background is probably not helping - a darker background such as black would help those hues really pop especially the hue tones in the blonde hair.</td>', 'The model has the poise and look to certainly invoke the idea of Roxie from Chicago, but the composition needs some improvement. First their are some rosy tones present in the skin but they are getting slightly washed out her and there and I think an exposure that is less ''overexposed'' would help not only bring out the rich rosy tones in skin color but also in overall hue of the colors present. For the composition you really wanted the yellow/blonde hues of the hair & the straps to the top/dress to really ''pop'' for the Yellow Challenge. As it stands here those rich, bold or vibrant hues are missing - they are too washed out. The color that really pops is those red lips. The red lipstick really calls attention to itself and is the hue that is most vibrant, bold and eye-catching. Not what you wanted because it robs attention away from the yellow hues you wish to be front & center in this composition. The white background is probably not helping - a darker background such as black would help those hues really pop especially the hue tones in the blonde hair.', '2006-04-03 10:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283244, 315821, 35545, '<td valign="top">A very cute idea, but the picture is cluttered.  I''d get rid of the plate of fruit in the background.  That way we could see the lemonheads better.</td>', 'A very cute idea, but the picture is cluttered.  I''d get rid of the plate of fruit in the background.  That way we could see the lemonheads better.', '2006-04-03 10:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283245, 315645, 38592, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot that stands out from the rest in the challenge.</td>', 'Very creative shot that stands out from the rest in the challenge.', '2006-04-03 10:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283249, 315734, 43463, '<td valign="top">I really love the arrangement of the elements in this composition. The action of the lemon wedge splashing into the glass and the water ripples at the base of the lemons outside of the glass really add some dynamic visual action. The only thing that really is lacking in this picture is the lack of sharpness and detail in the focusing on the objects. Had this image captured all the lovely details in sharp detail of the lemon circles, the lemon wedge splashing into the glass and the ''pores'' of the full lemon this would have definately been a contender in the top ten.</td>', 'I really love the arrangement of the elements in this composition. The action of the lemon wedge splashing into the glass and the water ripples at the base of the lemons outside of the glass really add some dynamic visual action. The only thing that really is lacking in this picture is the lack of sharpness and detail in the focusing on the objects. Had this image captured all the lovely details in sharp detail of the lemon circles, the lemon wedge splashing into the glass and the ''pores'' of the full lemon this would have definately been a contender in the top ten.', '2006-04-03 10:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283250, 315150, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast between the wrinkled background and the smooth cloth (?) that the vase is standing on.  Good lighting brings out the texture in the wrinkles.  A well composed and well executed shot.</td>', 'I really like the contrast between the wrinkled background and the smooth cloth (?) that the vase is standing on.  Good lighting brings out the texture in the wrinkles.  A well composed and well executed shot.', '2006-04-03 10:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
