(2283322, 313343, 43463, '<td valign="top">Composition is simple and clean in presentation. The yellow hues in these two balancing act glasses really captures the eye''s attention. Not to mention it makes the viewer do a double take and take a good long look at the liquids that seem to be defying gravitation. Lighting to illuminate the subject is very good. The only critique I have for this is that the reflection of the bottom glass on the surface is destracting and detracting attention away from the main focus which is your subject of the two balancing glasses. Either a close crop to the lip of the bottom one would eliminate that reflection or a less reflective surface that does not reflect the object''s image back would greatly improve the overall composition ot this piece.</td>', 'Composition is simple and clean in presentation. The yellow hues in these two balancing act glasses really captures the eye''s attention. Not to mention it makes the viewer do a double take and take a good long look at the liquids that seem to be defying gravitation. Lighting to illuminate the subject is very good. The only critique I have for this is that the reflection of the bottom glass on the surface is destracting and detracting attention away from the main focus which is your subject of the two balancing glasses. Either a close crop to the lip of the bottom one would eliminate that reflection or a less reflective surface that does not reflect the object''s image back would greatly improve the overall composition ot this piece.', '2006-04-03 11:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283327, 313648, 6388, '<td valign="top">a drink...that''s what i need...a drink!  beautifully done.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'a drink...that''s what i need...a drink!  beautifully done. P', '2006-04-03 11:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283330, 315785, 31443, '<td valign="top">Wonder how many outside the US would know what a "lemon" is...very creative, hope you got the dirt off your model :)</td>', 'Wonder how many outside the US would know what a "lemon" is...very creative, hope you got the dirt off your model :)', '2006-04-03 11:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283345, 314622, 43463, '<td valign="top">The level of sharp details in this photo are top notch. However there are some elements in the composition that need some improvement. First, love the deep rich hue seen on the spool to the right. However that deep rich hue does not continue to the spool that lays horizontal to the left. The light bounces off the thread and creates a shiny shine or glare that is a little too distracting to the overall image. Next since most of the implements/elements in this shot invoke the idea of sewing (including the title) I am surprised to find that there is not a sewing needle to be found in the composition. I think the addition of that object would strengthen the composition and better suit the title you have bestowed on the piece.</td>', 'The level of sharp details in this photo are top notch. However there are some elements in the composition that need some improvement. First, love the deep rich hue seen on the spool to the right. However that deep rich hue does not continue to the spool that lays horizontal to the left. The light bounces off the thread and creates a shiny shine or glare that is a little too distracting to the overall image. Next since most of the implements/elements in this shot invoke the idea of sewing (including the title) I am surprised to find that there is not a sewing needle to be found in the composition. I think the addition of that object would strengthen the composition and better suit the title you have bestowed on the piece.', '2006-04-03 11:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283356, 314284, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully creative idea!! Composition of elements is very good but technical presentation needs a bit of improvement. Lighting is one thing that could be better as that there are some distracting shadows on the fork and the peeps. Mayhap this would be eliminated by a straight on overhead shot that would throw the shadows behind/underneath the main objects (akin to what happens to your shadow at 12 noon as that the sun is directly overhead and makes the shadow ''disappear''). Illumination would be better on the peeps AND you would see more of that bold silver hue and sheen of the fork. Lastly, I think the background could have been better for this composition. The flat cream hue does nothing to make the main subjects visually ''pop'' off the page - a flat bright white or a flat dark black can accomplish that. In addition the background here has lines present in it such that it is an unwanted added ''texture'' that detracts from the main focus.</td>', 'Wonderfully creative idea!! Composition of elements is very good but technical presentation needs a bit of improvement. Lighting is one thing that could be better as that there are some distracting shadows on the fork and the peeps. Mayhap this would be eliminated by a straight on overhead shot that would throw the shadows behind/underneath the main objects (akin to what happens to your shadow at 12 noon as that the sun is directly overhead and makes the shadow ''disappear''). Illumination would be better on the peeps AND you would see more of that bold silver hue and sheen of the fork. Lastly, I think the background could have been better for this composition. The flat cream hue does nothing to make the main subjects visually ''pop'' off the page - a flat bright white or a flat dark black can accomplish that. In addition the background here has lines present in it such that it is an unwanted added ''texture'' that detracts from the main focus.', '2006-04-03 11:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283374, 315656, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice clean lines, muted tones though, almost looks more orange than yellow but the setup is done very well and well composed overall.  A 7</td>', 'Nice clean lines, muted tones though, almost looks more orange than yellow but the setup is done very well and well composed overall.  A 7', '2006-04-03 11:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283375, 312764, 12448, '<td valign="top">Okay, this is different, creative and unique.  You do get points for that! :)  The idea is wonderful but the elements used to convey the idea are a bit confusing and rather hard to see exactly what is supposed to be happening.  There seems to be some jpeg artifacting going on as well. :(  But like I said, points for creativity!  A 6</td>', 'Okay, this is different, creative and unique.  You do get points for that! :)  The idea is wonderful but the elements used to convey the idea are a bit confusing and rather hard to see exactly what is supposed to be happening.  There seems to be some jpeg artifacting going on as well. :(  But like I said, points for creativity!  A 6', '2006-04-03 11:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283376, 313832, 43463, '<td valign="top">I love the creative idea that you have captured here!!! The emply shell of this yellow pear is held together by yellow thread. The juicy heart of the matter is gone but the stiched up shell is presented in such a way that the viewer still  can sink their teeth into this conceptual shot and ''taste'' the flavor of its meaning. Wonderfully executed; the lighting is spot on and the focus is great with lots of details present in the skin of the pear. The only critique I have for this piece is that the background color does nothing to complement the subject. That dull plum purple hue is rather detracting from the main subject. A bold or vibrant hue (say green) would complement this subject better and really make it visually pop off instead of withdraw on the page. A solid black background could do that for the focal point as well but then you would not have a really rich &amp; vibrant color from which to bounce this off of. Great job, I can see this in the top 20.</td>', 'I love the creative idea that you have captured here!!! The emply shell of this yellow pear is held together by yellow thread. The juicy heart of the matter is gone but the stiched up shell is presented in such a way that the viewer still  can sink their teeth into this conceptual shot and ''taste'' the flavor of its meaning. Wonderfully executed; the lighting is spot on and the focus is great with lots of details present in the skin of the pear. The only critique I have for this piece is that the background color does nothing to complement the subject. That dull plum purple hue is rather detracting from the main subject. A bold or vibrant hue (say green) would complement this subject better and really make it visually pop off instead of withdraw on the page. A solid black background could do that for the focal point as well but then you would not have a really rich & vibrant color from which to bounce this off of. Great job, I can see this in the top 20.', '2006-04-03 11:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283377, 315673, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes they are and a yellow ankle bracelet.  A rather boring shot overall though, nothing to hold my attention and keep it here.  Sorry a 4</td>', 'Yes they are and a yellow ankle bracelet.  A rather boring shot overall though, nothing to hold my attention and keep it here.  Sorry a 4', '2006-04-03 11:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283380, 315385, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes it is, just starting around here as well.  Had to look for the yellow here and finally saw a bit of it on the edges.  Though it really comes off as more a green than yellow overall, even on the edges.  The shot is lovely and the backlighting is well done.  I''m guessing you put a black board behind to create the backdrop, good choice.  A bit fuzzy but then they are supposed to be, right?  :)  The composition leaves me just a bit off for some reason, like it''s not quite balanced one way or another.  Not sure why.  A 5</td>', 'Yes it is, just starting around here as well.  Had to look for the yellow here and finally saw a bit of it on the edges.  Though it really comes off as more a green than yellow overall, even on the edges.  The shot is lovely and the backlighting is well done.  I''m guessing you put a black board behind to create the backdrop, good choice.  A bit fuzzy but then they are supposed to be, right?  :)  The composition leaves me just a bit off for some reason, like it''s not quite balanced one way or another.  Not sure why.  A 5', '2006-04-03 11:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283381, 315743, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very crisp, clear and YELLOW! :)  Well balanced, good details.  Good stock shot.  A 7</td>', 'Very crisp, clear and YELLOW! :)  Well balanced, good details.  Good stock shot.  A 7', '2006-04-03 11:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283382, 312811, 6388, '<td valign="top">adorable :)  I like the muted colours a lot;  the blown highlights on the zipper steal some of the facial detail, but not a big deal since the eyes draw you in anyway.  nicely done.</td>', 'adorable :)  I like the muted colours a lot;  the blown highlights on the zipper steal some of the facial detail, but not a big deal since the eyes draw you in anyway.  nicely done.', '2006-04-03 11:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283384, 315419, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure I understand the title so instead I''ll concentrate on the shot.  Nide idea, like the idea that the flower was just flicked off the stem but that hand seems a bit small to be able to pull that off.  The focus is a bit soft or fuzzy and the color of the flower and the hand just don''t seem to be at the same level of brightness or contrast.  Love the idea though.  A 5</td>', 'Not sure I understand the title so instead I''ll concentrate on the shot.  Nide idea, like the idea that the flower was just flicked off the stem but that hand seems a bit small to be able to pull that off.  The focus is a bit soft or fuzzy and the color of the flower and the hand just don''t seem to be at the same level of brightness or contrast.  Love the idea though.  A 5', '2006-04-03 11:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283385, 312291, 12448, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  Nice that you got such a great shot and the duck looking at you no less.  Excellent colors, no overall orange here. :)  An 8</td>', 'Sweet!  Nice that you got such a great shot and the duck looking at you no less.  Excellent colors, no overall orange here. :)  An 8', '2006-04-03 11:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
