(2283396, 315734, 12448, '<td valign="top">Okay, cleaned my monitor before commenting on this one, wanted to make sure it wasn''t smudges on my monitor.  And it''s not, I love the idea, it''s very cute and well done in the end but the post processing really hurt this shot in the end.  The blur on the lemon to the right and that odd little set of lines under it are really distracting and on the leave on the left, it''s sharp on the top and blurred out on the bottom. :(  This really hurts the shot.  If it was all clear I would have given this an 8 but as it is it''s dropping to a 5</td>', 'Okay, cleaned my monitor before commenting on this one, wanted to make sure it wasn''t smudges on my monitor.  And it''s not, I love the idea, it''s very cute and well done in the end but the post processing really hurt this shot in the end.  The blur on the lemon to the right and that odd little set of lines under it are really distracting and on the leave on the left, it''s sharp on the top and blurred out on the bottom. :(  This really hurts the shot.  If it was all clear I would have given this an 8 but as it is it''s dropping to a 5', '2006-04-03 11:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283398, 313875, 12448, '<td valign="top">Why, yes it does!  Nice overall shot of the bike but that big wheel thing/sculpture on the left ruins the whole shot.  Really distracting tot he shot.  Otherwise this would have made a decent stock photo.  The colors are nice, the clarity is there.  A 6</td>', 'Why, yes it does!  Nice overall shot of the bike but that big wheel thing/sculpture on the left ruins the whole shot.  Really distracting tot he shot.  Otherwise this would have made a decent stock photo.  The colors are nice, the clarity is there.  A 6', '2006-04-03 11:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283403, 315783, 12448, '<td valign="top">YES IT DOES! :)  Very cute idea, out of the box as they say and you will be rewarded for that with me.  I like the idea but one thing bothered me when this first came up and still bothers me more as I look at it.  The lack of focus on the cloth.  I know you''re highlighting and want the viewer to look at the vaccum but the out of focus cloth keeps taking my attention away and bugs the crap out of me, LOL :)  But your score won''t suffer too much for that.  An 8</td>', 'YES IT DOES! :)  Very cute idea, out of the box as they say and you will be rewarded for that with me.  I like the idea but one thing bothered me when this first came up and still bothers me more as I look at it.  The lack of focus on the cloth.  I know you''re highlighting and want the viewer to look at the vaccum but the out of focus cloth keeps taking my attention away and bugs the crap out of me, LOL :)  But your score won''t suffer too much for that.  An 8', '2006-04-03 11:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
