(2283513, 312581, 12448, '<td valign="top">Capturing flames are hard because they can easily glow out in the highlights.  This one is very close on the top of the flame.  Also the noise factor is a bit distracting, almost like you shot it through a very fine mesh screen or something.  The reflection of the flame on the front is also a bit distracting.  A 4</td>', 'Capturing flames are hard because they can easily glow out in the highlights.  This one is very close on the top of the flame.  Also the noise factor is a bit distracting, almost like you shot it through a very fine mesh screen or something.  The reflection of the flame on the front is also a bit distracting.  A 4', '2006-04-03 12:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
