(2283522, 315766, 12448, '<td valign="top">How cute!  And the look over the shoulder is priceless, lucky he didn''t blow away with all those balloons! :)  There seems to be a bit of noise involved here and the colors are very muted.  I like the overall composition, the balance is well done with the subjects but I really would love to either see more color or have all but the balloons desaturated, it''s like it''s right in between.  A 6</td>', 'How cute!  And the look over the shoulder is priceless, lucky he didn''t blow away with all those balloons! :)  There seems to be a bit of noise involved here and the colors are very muted.  I like the overall composition, the balance is well done with the subjects but I really would love to either see more color or have all but the balloons desaturated, it''s like it''s right in between.  A 6', '2006-04-03 12:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
