(2283528, 314978, 28710, '<td valign="top">Being a big fan of highly precise mathematical tools that I have no idea how to use, I like this. My only complaint is that you left it sooo close to the background. Certainly it is within the realm of possibility to bring it away from the BG in this one?</td>', 'Being a big fan of highly precise mathematical tools that I have no idea how to use, I like this. My only complaint is that you left it sooo close to the background. Certainly it is within the realm of possibility to bring it away from the BG in this one?', '2006-04-03 12:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
