(2283599, 315675, 28710, '<td valign="top">Love the idea!</td>', 'Love the idea!', '2006-04-03 13:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283601, 315423, 26845, '<td valign="top">LoL I am at work and we transfer these here... I guess I better get back to work...</td>', 'LoL I am at work and we transfer these here... I guess I better get back to work...', '2006-04-03 13:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283603, 314751, 26845, '<td valign="top">Golden Ragwort? Nice Shot BTW.</td>', 'Golden Ragwort? Nice Shot BTW.', '2006-04-03 13:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283611, 315685, 47096, '<td valign="top">Cute, but the chain across the top is a bit disturbing. Cropping it out might be an idea.</td>', 'Cute, but the chain across the top is a bit disturbing. Cropping it out might be an idea.', '2006-04-03 13:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283613, 314732, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. Vibrant color. I like the focus being on the yellow tulip.Crisp and clear image. Good luck! 8</td>', 'Beautiful capture. Vibrant color. I like the focus being on the yellow tulip.Crisp and clear image. Good luck! 8', '2006-04-03 13:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283616, 315313, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.</td>', 'Beautiful image.', '2006-04-03 13:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283621, 315567, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture. Beautiful model. Vibrant yellow really accentuates her eyes. Good job! 9</td>', 'Outstanding capture. Beautiful model. Vibrant yellow really accentuates her eyes. Good job! 9', '2006-04-03 13:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283626, 315654, 43565, '<td valign="top">I wish this was more in focus.</td>', 'I wish this was more in focus.', '2006-04-03 13:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283628, 315695, 43565, '<td valign="top">The focus is too soft for me.</td>', 'The focus is too soft for me.', '2006-04-03 13:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283631, 315206, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great color contrasts, interesting perspective.  The lighting is pretty harsh, but its hard to tame sunlight (maybe some kind of diffuser prop if it was big enough?).  The focus seems fairly soft here, which because of the macro-esque nature of the image is a drawback.  I do like the composition.  5.</td>', 'Great color contrasts, interesting perspective.  The lighting is pretty harsh, but its hard to tame sunlight (maybe some kind of diffuser prop if it was big enough?).  The focus seems fairly soft here, which because of the macro-esque nature of the image is a drawback.  I do like the composition.  5.', '2006-04-03 13:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283633, 315751, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think the "worms" should be more in focus.</td>', 'I think the "worms" should be more in focus.', '2006-04-03 13:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283634, 314769, 29293, '<td valign="top">too small your border is over done</td>', 'too small your border is over done', '2006-04-03 13:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283640, 314732, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice colors.  I like the fact you have a green background for your subjects, helps meld the stems into oblivion.  The lighting is VERY harsh in the image, I can''t be sure whether it is sunlight or man-made, if man-made I would suggest both a diffuser and perhaps some way of backlighting the yellow tulip more, giving it a bit more of a glow.  If the sun, then a large piece of tissue paper strategically placed or something similar to tone down the hard light.  The other thing I''m finding problematic is the focus.  It looks fairly good on the stem and leaves of the yellow tulip but the main focus (IMO) should be the petal area of the tulip and the water drop.  Yellow seems to have a way of blotting out details so attention to focus on the petals would probably give this image a bit more oomph.  5.</td>', 'Good composition, nice colors.  I like the fact you have a green background for your subjects, helps meld the stems into oblivion.  The lighting is VERY harsh in the image, I can''t be sure whether it is sunlight or man-made, if man-made I would suggest both a diffuser and perhaps some way of backlighting the yellow tulip more, giving it a bit more of a glow.  If the sun, then a large piece of tissue paper strategically placed or something similar to tone down the hard light.  The other thing I''m finding problematic is the focus.  It looks fairly good on the stem and leaves of the yellow tulip but the main focus (IMO) should be the petal area of the tulip and the water drop.  Yellow seems to have a way of blotting out details so attention to focus on the petals would probably give this image a bit more oomph.  5.', '2006-04-03 13:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283648, 314041, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, nice silhouette.  I don''t like the balance of the image though.  I''m not sure if a shift of position so just that branch on the right was being silhouetted and the rest of the palm was either forming a dark left-hand border or not in the image at all would be possible or better.  While the focus is good there does seem to be something missing from the image, the POP isn''t there.  I''m not sure if that''s a focus issue or something else though.  5</td>', 'Beautiful colors, nice silhouette.  I don''t like the balance of the image though.  I''m not sure if a shift of position so just that branch on the right was being silhouetted and the rest of the palm was either forming a dark left-hand border or not in the image at all would be possible or better.  While the focus is good there does seem to be something missing from the image, the POP isn''t there.  I''m not sure if that''s a focus issue or something else though.  5', '2006-04-03 13:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283669, 313963, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is orange, at least on my monitor.</td>', 'This is orange, at least on my monitor.', '2006-04-03 13:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283672, 315318, 38592, '<td valign="top">nice pic.... a bit soft but still works.  I hate the border though (not going to mark you down for that though)</td>', 'nice pic.... a bit soft but still works.  I hate the border though (not going to mark you down for that though)', '2006-04-03 13:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283712, 313556, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent image choice.  I like the composition, the color for the most part is very vibrant.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the left and I wish there was some sort of fill on the right to bring out the yellow in the thread over there (its gone to an orangey color).  It may help give more definition and added texture.   The focus is good but not pin sharp, which I think brings some of the POP out of the image.  Overall a nice photo.  5.</td>', 'Excellent image choice.  I like the composition, the color for the most part is very vibrant.  The lighting is a bit harsh on the left and I wish there was some sort of fill on the right to bring out the yellow in the thread over there (its gone to an orangey color).  It may help give more definition and added texture.   The focus is good but not pin sharp, which I think brings some of the POP out of the image.  Overall a nice photo.  5.', '2006-04-03 14:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283713, 314281, 22689, '<td valign="top">Those are beautiful flowers,very delicate but I think that you could have made then even more appealing , white tones are a bit grey ; nice focus and composition.</td>', 'Those are beautiful flowers,very delicate but I think that you could have made then even more appealing , white tones are a bit grey ; nice focus and composition.', '2006-04-03 14:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283720, 313446, 37961, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the laugh!! LOL FUNNY</td>', 'Thanks for the laugh!! LOL FUNNY', '2006-04-03 14:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283727, 315331, 11923, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge, has some nice action and movement.  The colors are a bit disappointing though.  There''s no richness.  Feels very hazy and flat.  Perhaps a polarizer may help more?  If you did use one then I don''t know what could help!  Looks like the Gorge here in Oregon, a nice action shot but it doesn''t really grab me.  4</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge, has some nice action and movement.  The colors are a bit disappointing though.  There''s no richness.  Feels very hazy and flat.  Perhaps a polarizer may help more?  If you did use one then I don''t know what could help!  Looks like the Gorge here in Oregon, a nice action shot but it doesn''t really grab me.  4', '2006-04-03 14:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283737, 315587, 12448, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Holland, don''t know why but it does.  Very nice shot, well composed and good DOF on the overall picture.  Nothing that really makes it stand out from the crowd but still very nice overall.  A 6</td>', 'Reminds me of Holland, don''t know why but it does.  Very nice shot, well composed and good DOF on the overall picture.  Nothing that really makes it stand out from the crowd but still very nice overall.  A 6', '2006-04-03 14:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283740, 315024, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love about half of this image.  The shade for the lamp is gorgeous, has wonderful colors and a great pattern that is picked up by the wall behind it.  So from where that lovely yellow glass shade starts and up, I love.  Everything below it, I hate.  If you were to reshoot it, I would suggest taping up a black piece of cloth or paper along the shadow-line of the wall to give it a richer black coloring than the lamp will allow, reshoot and crop it right at where the lampshade starts up from the base.  If it worked right I think it would give a great sense of color contrast with the deep black and the yellow/red and add a bit of punch.  I wouldn''t extend the material higher than the natural shadowline only because it would probably look unnatural and obviously material-ish with the direct light on it, instead of melding as it *should* into the shadows beneath.  Just an idea.  As is I like the potential of the image but not its current presentation.  4</td>', 'I love about half of this image.  The shade for the lamp is gorgeous, has wonderful colors and a great pattern that is picked up by the wall behind it.  So from where that lovely yellow glass shade starts and up, I love.  Everything below it, I hate.  If you were to reshoot it, I would suggest taping up a black piece of cloth or paper along the shadow-line of the wall to give it a richer black coloring than the lamp will allow, reshoot and crop it right at where the lampshade starts up from the base.  If it worked right I think it would give a great sense of color contrast with the deep black and the yellow/red and add a bit of punch.  I wouldn''t extend the material higher than the natural shadowline only because it would probably look unnatural and obviously material-ish with the direct light on it, instead of melding as it *should* into the shadows beneath.  Just an idea.  As is I like the potential of the image but not its current presentation.  4', '2006-04-03 14:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283746, 315024, 12448, '<td valign="top">A unique approach, you get a point for that.  But it comes off more orange than yellow to me in the overall shot, the yellow is around the base but it''s overshadowed by the dark oranges surrounding it.  Also seems a bit soft on the focus, just a touch.  A 6</td>', 'A unique approach, you get a point for that.  But it comes off more orange than yellow to me in the overall shot, the yellow is around the base but it''s overshadowed by the dark oranges surrounding it.  Also seems a bit soft on the focus, just a touch.  A 6', '2006-04-03 14:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283749, 315744, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice Landscape shot, not really seeing a lot of yellow, more tan and blue and dark green though.  A 5</td>', 'Nice Landscape shot, not really seeing a lot of yellow, more tan and blue and dark green though.  A 5', '2006-04-03 14:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283751, 314258, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh, how cute!  Nice find and not a bad capture overall.  The DOF is really shallow on this one, too bad you could get more of the center of the flower in focus with the ladybug and even that seems a tad off on the focus.  A 6</td>', 'Oh, how cute!  Nice find and not a bad capture overall.  The DOF is really shallow on this one, too bad you could get more of the center of the flower in focus with the ladybug and even that seems a tad off on the focus.  A 6', '2006-04-03 14:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283752, 315794, 11923, '<td valign="top">A fun image!  I like the dynamic of the image, the lighting and composition is good.  The focus seems a bit weird, or maybe its been overly sharpened or something.. some haloing of artifacts around the yellow flower.  Nice photo 5.</td>', 'A fun image!  I like the dynamic of the image, the lighting and composition is good.  The focus seems a bit weird, or maybe its been overly sharpened or something.. some haloing of artifacts around the yellow flower.  Nice photo 5.', '2006-04-03 14:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283753, 315715, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hello!  That is what that little flower seems to be saying while the other one is saying, "I''m shy, don''t look at me."<br/> <br/>Nice composition, good DOF, colors are there but not really saying much to me overall, seems just a touch too muted for my personal taste but otherwise a wonderful shot.  A 7</td>', 'Hello!  That is what that little flower seems to be saying while the other one is saying, "I''m shy, don''t look at me." Nice composition, good DOF, colors are there but not really saying much to me overall, seems just a touch too muted for my personal taste but otherwise a wonderful shot.  A 7', '2006-04-03 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283757, 315670, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice simple presentation.  Good color scheme (there''s many yellows to choose from!).  I do not like the lighting on here.  Maybe if there were a slight fill light on the left side to disperse more (but not all) of the shadows I''d like it better.  The lighting on the right side is very harsh and I think that detracts from the image, especially the way it is reflecting off of the lemon rind.  The focus is decent but a bit soft.  Yellow seems to swallow up detailing for some reason, I wish it were a bit crisper.  4</td>', 'A nice simple presentation.  Good color scheme (there''s many yellows to choose from!).  I do not like the lighting on here.  Maybe if there were a slight fill light on the left side to disperse more (but not all) of the shadows I''d like it better.  The lighting on the right side is very harsh and I think that detracts from the image, especially the way it is reflecting off of the lemon rind.  The focus is decent but a bit soft.  Yellow seems to swallow up detailing for some reason, I wish it were a bit crisper.  4', '2006-04-03 14:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283763, 315803, 11923, '<td valign="top">Quite a cute title.  Lovely lighting, nice focus.  The contrast between the ladybug and the flower works perfectly.  The somewhat softer portion of the flower on the right side is a tad distracting, but cropping it out would lose the nice balance the image has.  Well done.  6</td>', 'Quite a cute title.  Lovely lighting, nice focus.  The contrast between the ladybug and the flower works perfectly.  The somewhat softer portion of the flower on the right side is a tad distracting, but cropping it out would lose the nice balance the image has.  Well done.  6', '2006-04-03 14:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283770, 313224, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a nice simple sunrise with some lovely colors.  The tree silhouette is more of a drawback for me since its taking my attention away from the sunrise but it does give the image another element.  I''m not sure what is missing from the photo for me though, after the initial "oh that''s pretty" there is nothing here that is keeping me engaged.  4</td>', 'This is a nice simple sunrise with some lovely colors.  The tree silhouette is more of a drawback for me since its taking my attention away from the sunrise but it does give the image another element.  I''m not sure what is missing from the photo for me though, after the initial "oh that''s pretty" there is nothing here that is keeping me engaged.  4', '2006-04-03 14:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283777, 315506, 11923, '<td valign="top">Kill me but I think this is cute.  I love the colors, that blue is out of this world.  The contrast between the sky and the rust and green of the ground is great.  Plus little Dasy the doll in her adorable rain slicker, I can totally see this as one of those kids'' news things they do on tv shows.  The steam gives the photo an extra interesting element (though it does obscure some nice features as well) and it helps to show off how wonderfully crisp the image is overall.  Very nice.  7.</td>', 'Kill me but I think this is cute.  I love the colors, that blue is out of this world.  The contrast between the sky and the rust and green of the ground is great.  Plus little Dasy the doll in her adorable rain slicker, I can totally see this as one of those kids'' news things they do on tv shows.  The steam gives the photo an extra interesting element (though it does obscure some nice features as well) and it helps to show off how wonderfully crisp the image is overall.  Very nice.  7.', '2006-04-03 14:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283785, 315377, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait.  The lighting for the most part is wonderful (there''s that hotspot on the left shoulder that draws my eye) and the focus is good too.  Nice color pop with the dandilion.  The one thing I don''t like about this is the background.  The grass and green/browns just isn''t doing it for me.  I think its because the earthy tones are making her brown hair blend too much into the background.  Still a nice portrait overall.  5</td>', 'Lovely portrait.  The lighting for the most part is wonderful (there''s that hotspot on the left shoulder that draws my eye) and the focus is good too.  Nice color pop with the dandilion.  The one thing I don''t like about this is the background.  The grass and green/browns just isn''t doing it for me.  I think its because the earthy tones are making her brown hair blend too much into the background.  Still a nice portrait overall.  5', '2006-04-03 14:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283793, 315686, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great hues.  Like the silhouettes, though I do wish one or two of the boats were a bit closer thus giving more detailed silhouetting.  The focus looks good but it seems a bit hazy out.  Could just be the yellowy nature of the image blotting out details but I wish it was crisper.  Very nice.  5</td>', 'Great hues.  Like the silhouettes, though I do wish one or two of the boats were a bit closer thus giving more detailed silhouetting.  The focus looks good but it seems a bit hazy out.  Could just be the yellowy nature of the image blotting out details but I wish it was crisper.  Very nice.  5', '2006-04-03 14:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283799, 315804, 11923, '<td valign="top">This has a cuteness for creativity but the overall presentation isn''t too impressive to me.  The banana looks kind of dirty and old, fruit seems to wither too quickly!  The lighting is good and the composition in general is good, but I think it would''ve been more dramatic or had more flare if there was a "scene" for the image.  Maybe the picture of a raging river as a background instead of the blank blackness?  I don''t know.  Seems oddly out of place to me.  4</td>', 'This has a cuteness for creativity but the overall presentation isn''t too impressive to me.  The banana looks kind of dirty and old, fruit seems to wither too quickly!  The lighting is good and the composition in general is good, but I think it would''ve been more dramatic or had more flare if there was a "scene" for the image.  Maybe the picture of a raging river as a background instead of the blank blackness?  I don''t know.  Seems oddly out of place to me.  4', '2006-04-03 14:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283806, 313409, 11923, '<td valign="top">Pretty bird.  I like the softness of the belly and the excellent contrasts the bird provides.  I also like the barbed wire, gives an added bit of interest.  The background is a bit boring but what can ya do about nature really?  Luckily the brilliant white of the bird helps it stand out from the background.  5</td>', 'Pretty bird.  I like the softness of the belly and the excellent contrasts the bird provides.  I also like the barbed wire, gives an added bit of interest.  The background is a bit boring but what can ya do about nature really?  Luckily the brilliant white of the bird helps it stand out from the background.  5', '2006-04-03 14:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283815, 313900, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Yellow is my favorite color.. but that''s one ugly bridge.  It has a nice pop effect, though i do find it slightly diminished by the yellows and greens in the hillside on the right.   I''m not sure about the perspective either.  The sky has a nice look to it and that tree has interest.  The bridge itself gives its own bit of interest but everything together seems a bit jumbled and I''m having a hard time finding something to focus on.  In fact my eyes are being drawn to the green more often than the yellow.  Not sure why.. maybe because its so clearly focused and closer to me the viewer.  Something just feels off-kilter with this image.  4</td>', 'Wow.  Yellow is my favorite color.. but that''s one ugly bridge.  It has a nice pop effect, though i do find it slightly diminished by the yellows and greens in the hillside on the right.   I''m not sure about the perspective either.  The sky has a nice look to it and that tree has interest.  The bridge itself gives its own bit of interest but everything together seems a bit jumbled and I''m having a hard time finding something to focus on.  In fact my eyes are being drawn to the green more often than the yellow.  Not sure why.. maybe because its so clearly focused and closer to me the viewer.  Something just feels off-kilter with this image.  4', '2006-04-03 14:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283820, 315186, 11923, '<td valign="top">No idea if there is a significance in the letters chosen or not, so it doesn''t speak to me through that method.  I like the high-key feel of the imagery, though I don''t imagine it will do all that well with some on here.  The colors are vibrant, the focus looks good.  Its a nice shot to the eye especially compared with some of the other images I''ve voted on today.  Different.  6.</td>', 'No idea if there is a significance in the letters chosen or not, so it doesn''t speak to me through that method.  I like the high-key feel of the imagery, though I don''t imagine it will do all that well with some on here.  The colors are vibrant, the focus looks good.  Its a nice shot to the eye especially compared with some of the other images I''ve voted on today.  Different.  6.', '2006-04-03 14:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283873, 313648, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites.....can''t get much better than this(and I don''t like beer!!).</td>', 'One of my favourites.....can''t get much better than this(and I don''t like beer!!).', '2006-04-03 15:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283874, 315335, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites, very cute and a wonderful composition.</td>', 'One of my favourites, very cute and a wonderful composition.', '2006-04-03 15:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283875, 315783, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites!</td>', 'One of my favourites!', '2006-04-03 15:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283876, 312862, 56494, '<td valign="top">This is quite an intesresting take on yellow, might have been better if she wasn`t looking directly at the camera maybe... but they are engaging in a way so, depending on how you look at it, it can be a pro - or a con for this picture.</td>', 'This is quite an intesresting take on yellow, might have been better if she wasn`t looking directly at the camera maybe... but they are engaging in a way so, depending on how you look at it, it can be a pro - or a con for this picture.', '2006-04-03 15:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283877, 313343, 43774, '<td valign="top">Jello? Very creative, I LOVE this pic</td>', 'Jello? Very creative, I LOVE this pic', '2006-04-03 15:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283878, 315788, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites, excellent clarity</td>', 'One of my favourites, excellent clarity', '2006-04-03 15:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283879, 315410, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites, I just love shots of boats.</td>', 'One of my favourites, I just love shots of boats.', '2006-04-03 15:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283880, 313597, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very well done</td>', 'Very well done', '2006-04-03 15:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283882, 314703, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity of this</td>', 'Love the simplicity of this', '2006-04-03 15:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283884, 314350, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, able to see so much detail in the flower, well done</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, able to see so much detail in the flower, well done', '2006-04-03 15:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283885, 315638, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I''d like to see it without the flowers blurred as well to see which way I prefer. But this is well done.</td>', 'Very nice. I''d like to see it without the flowers blurred as well to see which way I prefer. But this is well done.', '2006-04-03 15:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283886, 313556, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro</td>', 'Wonderful macro', '2006-04-03 15:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283887, 315169, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very funny, excellent composition, very clear, well done</td>', 'Very funny, excellent composition, very clear, well done', '2006-04-03 15:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283888, 315438, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the clarity and colours, well done</td>', 'Love the clarity and colours, well done', '2006-04-03 15:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283889, 315365, 43774, '<td valign="top">So cute, I really like this one. Could be a tad brighter.</td>', 'So cute, I really like this one. Could be a tad brighter.', '2006-04-03 15:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283890, 313872, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great clarity, excellent macro.</td>', 'Great clarity, excellent macro.', '2006-04-03 15:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283891, 313842, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! One of the best flower shots in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful! One of the best flower shots in the challenge.', '2006-04-03 15:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283892, 314681, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, not overly fond of the shadows. But still one of the top photos in the contest.</td>', 'I really like the composition, not overly fond of the shadows. But still one of the top photos in the contest.', '2006-04-03 15:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283893, 312808, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love it!!</td>', 'Love it!!', '2006-04-03 15:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2283894, 315150, 32369, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet very eye catching. I like the lighting and the simple background. I wonder how it would have looked with a blue vase to act as a contrast color. I think the colors would have really popped with a blue vase.  Well done!</td>', 'Simple, yet very eye catching. I like the lighting and the simple background. I wonder how it would have looked with a blue vase to act as a contrast color. I think the colors would have really popped with a blue vase.  Well done!', '2006-04-03 15:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
