(2284107, 315328, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  It looks more like sand that has had yellow paint put over it but I guess if you get close enough to the pavement it would look like that.  Nothing really exciting here, sorry a 4</td>', 'Interesting.  It looks more like sand that has had yellow paint put over it but I guess if you get close enough to the pavement it would look like that.  Nothing really exciting here, sorry a 4', '2006-04-03 16:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284112, 315814, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yep, it sure is.  If you could have had a more solid background, say all blue this would score higher in my book.  The building with the line coming right our of her nose is very distracting, even caught my attention in the thumbnails.  Otherwise the colors and clarity are wonderful. A 6</td>', 'Yep, it sure is.  If you could have had a more solid background, say all blue this would score higher in my book.  The building with the line coming right our of her nose is very distracting, even caught my attention in the thumbnails.  Otherwise the colors and clarity are wonderful. A 6', '2006-04-03 16:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284118, 313867, 12448, '<td valign="top">Whoa, that''s one yellow eye!  How did you ever get your cat to sit still long enough for you to get that close, LOL :)  I''m guessing a long lense. :)<br/> <br/>Nice clarity, focus and sharpness around the eye but then in the eye it gets really soft to me.  And that red line down the side is really distracting.  An 8</td>', 'Whoa, that''s one yellow eye!  How did you ever get your cat to sit still long enough for you to get that close, LOL :)  I''m guessing a long lense. :) Nice clarity, focus and sharpness around the eye but then in the eye it gets really soft to me.  And that red line down the side is really distracting.  An 8', '2006-04-03 16:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284121, 315304, 12448, '<td valign="top">Aw, signs of spring!  Lovely shot, good composition but no wow factor, nothing really jumps out at me and says STAY HERE AND LOOK AT ME! :)  SOrry, a 5</td>', 'Aw, signs of spring!  Lovely shot, good composition but no wow factor, nothing really jumps out at me and says STAY HERE AND LOOK AT ME! :)  SOrry, a 5', '2006-04-03 16:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
