(2284129, 313900, 12448, '<td valign="top">I guess!  WOW! You''ll see that one for a couple of miles down the road!  Nice landscape shot and for this challenge it fits well because of the yellow but the bridge color hurts the rest of the picture to me.  I"ll split the difference and give you a 6,kay? :)</td>', 'I guess!  WOW! You''ll see that one for a couple of miles down the road!  Nice landscape shot and for this challenge it fits well because of the yellow but the bridge color hurts the rest of the picture to me.  I"ll split the difference and give you a 6,kay? :)', '2006-04-03 16:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
