(2284135, 313888, 12448, '<td valign="top">Lovely flowers, beautiful sky but the whole thing seems too muted to me.  The sky is so bright but the bottom is so dark, more balance or flip flop the contrast and brightness and I think this one would sing to me, looks like they want to! :)  A 6</td>', 'Lovely flowers, beautiful sky but the whole thing seems too muted to me.  The sky is so bright but the bottom is so dark, more balance or flip flop the contrast and brightness and I think this one would sing to me, looks like they want to! :)  A 6', '2006-04-03 16:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284138, 314913, 12448, '<td valign="top">ooooo, that is an usual color of sky.  Not sure I''ve ever seen it like that and not sure I like it like that too much either.  Not really coming off as golden, more like someone put a yellow filter on the camera and shot.  If the ocean was more colorful to contrast the sky this might work much better.  a 5</td>', 'ooooo, that is an usual color of sky.  Not sure I''ve ever seen it like that and not sure I like it like that too much either.  Not really coming off as golden, more like someone put a yellow filter on the camera and shot.  If the ocean was more colorful to contrast the sky this might work much better.  a 5', '2006-04-03 16:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284144, 315034, 12448, '<td valign="top">Why yes it is.  Nice flower but nothing spectacular that makes me want to hold it.  Maybe if the angle was a little higher and I could see the center of the flower more and the color popped just a bit more?  A 6</td>', 'Why yes it is.  Nice flower but nothing spectacular that makes me want to hold it.  Maybe if the angle was a little higher and I could see the center of the flower more and the color popped just a bit more?  A 6', '2006-04-03 16:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
