(2284164, 313880, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes it is.  Nice idea, the black background is also a very good choice.  This would score very high for me except it''s out of focus.  If you were going for a soft focus, it doesn''t work for me on this shot, clarity would have scored you an 8 or 9, as is a 6</td>', 'Yes it is.  Nice idea, the black background is also a very good choice.  This would score very high for me except it''s out of focus.  If you were going for a soft focus, it doesn''t work for me on this shot, clarity would have scored you an 8 or 9, as is a 6', '2006-04-03 16:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
