(2284189, 315169, 12448, '<td valign="top">MURDERER!!! :)  LOL!  I love it, it''s lovely, it''s clear, it''s sharp, it''s funny and it''s interesting!  Good balance, composition and lines.  A 10</td>', 'MURDERER!!! :)  LOL!  I love it, it''s lovely, it''s clear, it''s sharp, it''s funny and it''s interesting!  Good balance, composition and lines.  A 10', '2006-04-03 16:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284192, 313844, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the title, I''m guessing because of the New car to the OLD house?  Nice car but the picture looks a bit tilted and the shadows on the car are a bit distracting.  A 5</td>', 'Not sure about the title, I''m guessing because of the New car to the OLD house?  Nice car but the picture looks a bit tilted and the shadows on the car are a bit distracting.  A 5', '2006-04-03 16:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284197, 313600, 2170, '<td valign="top">i think if the subject were further from the background (less shadow) this would be more fun.</td>', 'i think if the subject were further from the background (less shadow) this would be more fun.', '2006-04-03 16:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284200, 315766, 2170, '<td valign="top">the overall tint of this shot looks off.</td>', 'the overall tint of this shot looks off.', '2006-04-03 16:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284201, 314584, 2170, '<td valign="top">if i vote this down, i''m sure she''ll kick my ass. sooo.... i won''t.</td>', 'if i vote this down, i''m sure she''ll kick my ass. sooo.... i won''t.', '2006-04-03 16:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284204, 314635, 12448, '<td valign="top">Aha, very risky!  But in a good way!  I like the crop, the curves to the straight line of the tie.  The arm behind the back is a bit distracting, maybe if it was in the front, holding the bottom of tie or just hanging at the side, where it is ruins the lovely curve of the body and pulls away from that line, but we''re not supposed to be looking at that, right?  The tie, oh yeah, the tie.  Nice colors, a slight orange tinge to it, maybe a slight curves adjustment to make the colors on the tie and skin stand out more?  Nice lighting overall.  A 7</td>', 'Aha, very risky!  But in a good way!  I like the crop, the curves to the straight line of the tie.  The arm behind the back is a bit distracting, maybe if it was in the front, holding the bottom of tie or just hanging at the side, where it is ruins the lovely curve of the body and pulls away from that line, but we''re not supposed to be looking at that, right?  The tie, oh yeah, the tie.  Nice colors, a slight orange tinge to it, maybe a slight curves adjustment to make the colors on the tie and skin stand out more?  Nice lighting overall.  A 7', '2006-04-03 16:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284209, 315598, 43774, '<td valign="top">LOL!! This is cute</td>', 'LOL!! This is cute', '2006-04-03 16:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284219, 314529, 12448, '<td valign="top">My what crooked little lines you have there!  The desaturation of the rest of the shot really brings out the lines and takes you right into the shot. But then I''m left there, stuck in the middle so I guess I''ll have to follow one up and one back, heh?  A 7</td>', 'My what crooked little lines you have there!  The desaturation of the rest of the shot really brings out the lines and takes you right into the shot. But then I''m left there, stuck in the middle so I guess I''ll have to follow one up and one back, heh?  A 7', '2006-04-03 16:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284223, 315475, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting on this shot.  I like the black background and the bright light underneath but all those splotches on the flower are very distracting.  If they are waterdrops they are not helping the image in my view, a dry flower with the light reaching up and slight around the edge would really make this a beautiful shot.  It''s a 6 as is though, so still very well done! :)</td>', 'Interesting lighting on this shot.  I like the black background and the bright light underneath but all those splotches on the flower are very distracting.  If they are waterdrops they are not helping the image in my view, a dry flower with the light reaching up and slight around the edge would really make this a beautiful shot.  It''s a 6 as is though, so still very well done! :)', '2006-04-03 16:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284227, 315597, 35645, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely pic with beautiful composition, but DNMC. I see some brown that has some yellow undertones, but I don''t see a true yellow (of any shade), and for me that''s not enough to meet this challenge in my opinion.</td>', 'It''s a lovely pic with beautiful composition, but DNMC. I see some brown that has some yellow undertones, but I don''t see a true yellow (of any shade), and for me that''s not enough to meet this challenge in my opinion.', '2006-04-03 16:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284234, 314769, 40718, '<td valign="top">First thumbnail that came up in the voting for me and I think it''s gorgeous.   I usually hate fat borders, but I think it works well here.  I''m sure you are getting lots of comments about it though.  DPC loves to hate borders.  I have first hand experience of that. ;) 8</td>', 'First thumbnail that came up in the voting for me and I think it''s gorgeous.   I usually hate fat borders, but I think it works well here.  I''m sure you are getting lots of comments about it though.  DPC loves to hate borders.  I have first hand experience of that. ;) 8', '2006-04-03 16:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284236, 315788, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful desat, and I love the textures in the fur. Wish the nose wasn''t in shadow and that we could see both eyes. The color is a bit off as far as actually being yellow, though.</td>', 'Beautiful desat, and I love the textures in the fur. Wish the nose wasn''t in shadow and that we could see both eyes. The color is a bit off as far as actually being yellow, though.', '2006-04-03 16:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284240, 314498, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the vibrant yellow background and I think you could easily get away with it be even more bold and vibrant. I like the title and how it plays to the visual pun but I think the choice of spring coils could have been much better. Stereotypically when we think of Spring we think of a renewal, everything is in bloom, new, and fresh. To pair the color of yellow which is typically a vibrant and happy color that pours forth imagery of new &amp; fresh with something that is old and discolored brings done the tone/mood of the imagery. Had these coils been bright and shiny springs it would complimented the bright, shiny, and happy imagery that is associated with the vibrant hue of yellow.</td>', 'Love the vibrant yellow background and I think you could easily get away with it be even more bold and vibrant. I like the title and how it plays to the visual pun but I think the choice of spring coils could have been much better. Stereotypically when we think of Spring we think of a renewal, everything is in bloom, new, and fresh. To pair the color of yellow which is typically a vibrant and happy color that pours forth imagery of new & fresh with something that is old and discolored brings done the tone/mood of the imagery. Had these coils been bright and shiny springs it would complimented the bright, shiny, and happy imagery that is associated with the vibrant hue of yellow.', '2006-04-03 16:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284241, 315318, 35645, '<td valign="top">Nice bright yellow, but a bit soft focused for my taste. I feel like the bee and the center of the flower should be absolutely crisp.</td>', 'Nice bright yellow, but a bit soft focused for my taste. I feel like the bee and the center of the flower should be absolutely crisp.', '2006-04-03 17:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284242, 313648, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful golden yellows. I like the foam, too. Only nitpicky thing I noticed is your horizon is off by about a half a degree - enough for me to notice. Otherwise a lovely pic.</td>', 'Beautiful golden yellows. I like the foam, too. Only nitpicky thing I noticed is your horizon is off by about a half a degree - enough for me to notice. Otherwise a lovely pic.', '2006-04-03 17:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284251, 315744, 35645, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. I see lots of brown and green and blue, but no yellow. Has the potential to be a good shot, but DNMC in my opinion.</td>', 'Hmmm. I see lots of brown and green and blue, but no yellow. Has the potential to be a good shot, but DNMC in my opinion.', '2006-04-03 17:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284254, 314974, 40718, '<td valign="top">Looks like the picture has a color cast and doesn''t quite have enough DOF (see upper right stem).</td>', 'Looks like the picture has a color cast and doesn''t quite have enough DOF (see upper right stem).', '2006-04-03 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284259, 314769, 35645, '<td valign="top">Lovely subject placement and crop, but the background is distracting. It''s ok on the left hand side, but the goldis-brown strak on the right just sticks out like a sore thumb.</td>', 'Lovely subject placement and crop, but the background is distracting. It''s ok on the left hand side, but the goldis-brown strak on the right just sticks out like a sore thumb.', '2006-04-03 17:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284261, 315307, 40718, '<td valign="top">excellent composition. 8 for now.</td>', 'excellent composition. 8 for now.', '2006-04-03 17:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284263, 314979, 20608, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge i like broken things</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge i like broken things', '2006-04-03 17:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284271, 315382, 43463, '<td valign="top">Enjoy reading by natural vegetable light which will cast a soft yellow glow not that harsh white light:-) Very well done. I like how the stem of the yellow pepper flows flawlessly into the electrical cord that plugs into the outlet. The black background was perfect for this composition because not only does it help the yellow visually pop but it also helps with the imagery that this is a light source that is plugged in to give off light to chase away the darkness - and it is a most attractive lantern with a lovely yellow glow:-) Well done.</td>', 'Enjoy reading by natural vegetable light which will cast a soft yellow glow not that harsh white light:-) Very well done. I like how the stem of the yellow pepper flows flawlessly into the electrical cord that plugs into the outlet. The black background was perfect for this composition because not only does it help the yellow visually pop but it also helps with the imagery that this is a light source that is plugged in to give off light to chase away the darkness - and it is a most attractive lantern with a lovely yellow glow:-) Well done.', '2006-04-03 17:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284276, 315228, 40718, '<td valign="top">A little too much glare and I''m not sure what''s up with the sunglasses.  She''s buff though and pretty. 7</td>', 'A little too much glare and I''m not sure what''s up with the sunglasses.  She''s buff though and pretty. 7', '2006-04-03 17:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284279, 315173, 35645, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this, but everything seems just a hair off. The clouds seem a little too blurry, the sun creates a very white hot spot, and the crop could probably stand to be a little tighter.</td>', 'Love the colors in this, but everything seems just a hair off. The clouds seem a little too blurry, the sun creates a very white hot spot, and the crop could probably stand to be a little tighter.', '2006-04-03 17:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284284, 314557, 40718, '<td valign="top">The three legs reminds me of the joke about "lean beef"...</td>', 'The three legs reminds me of the joke about "lean beef"...', '2006-04-03 17:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284286, 313880, 35645, '<td valign="top">The composition on this is nice, but not terribly interesting. There''s nothing enticing me to stay and look some more. Perhaps the addition of another flower or a bug or some water drops or something would give it a little ''lift''. Also, the center of the flower seems to be too soft, and there''s a weird spot of blue at the lower left of the flower.</td>', 'The composition on this is nice, but not terribly interesting. There''s nothing enticing me to stay and look some more. Perhaps the addition of another flower or a bug or some water drops or something would give it a little ''lift''. Also, the center of the flower seems to be too soft, and there''s a weird spot of blue at the lower left of the flower.', '2006-04-03 17:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284292, 313832, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Love the concept. The lighting seems a bit harsh (bit of a hot spot on the peel - can be corrected by diffusing the light). Good choice of background color.</td>', 'Very creative. Love the concept. The lighting seems a bit harsh (bit of a hot spot on the peel - can be corrected by diffusing the light). Good choice of background color.', '2006-04-03 17:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284296, 313960, 43463, '<td valign="top">The dark black background really makes the warm hues of the oranges and yellows of this flower visually pop. Lighting on subject is good and really complements the flower. The biggest problem with the composition is lack of good focus. The  flower could be in sharper focus such that more details could be seen in the folds of the petals and sharpness of the objects edges. Not sure how the title relates or compliments the composition. This is a good shot but for lack of sharp focus it could be even better.</td>', 'The dark black background really makes the warm hues of the oranges and yellows of this flower visually pop. Lighting on subject is good and really complements the flower. The biggest problem with the composition is lack of good focus. The  flower could be in sharper focus such that more details could be seen in the folds of the petals and sharpness of the objects edges. Not sure how the title relates or compliments the composition. This is a good shot but for lack of sharp focus it could be even better.', '2006-04-03 17:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284299, 314671, 35645, '<td valign="top">This definitely meets the challenge, but could stand to be re-worked, compositionally speaking. The tilt of the placemat and cutting off the top of the flowers looks makes it look like this was a last-minute-snapshot rather than a well-planned photo. I can see that there was at least a little planning, and I can see where this could be a really good shot, it just looks overly rushed.</td>', 'This definitely meets the challenge, but could stand to be re-worked, compositionally speaking. The tilt of the placemat and cutting off the top of the flowers looks makes it look like this was a last-minute-snapshot rather than a well-planned photo. I can see that there was at least a little planning, and I can see where this could be a really good shot, it just looks overly rushed.', '2006-04-03 17:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284307, 315511, 35645, '<td valign="top">Looks a little under-exposed to me, and while it may have been a conscious decision to under-expose, it''s not one that really appeals to me. Compositionally, it''s pleasant, and I like the detail that can be seen. It just looks a bit too dark.</td>', 'Looks a little under-exposed to me, and while it may have been a conscious decision to under-expose, it''s not one that really appeals to me. Compositionally, it''s pleasant, and I like the detail that can be seen. It just looks a bit too dark.', '2006-04-03 17:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284312, 314364, 35645, '<td valign="top">I''m curious to know if the bridge really is yellow. Won''t affect the score, just curious. It''s a decent shot. There seems to be a lot of haze that''s obscuring most of the photo (I know you can''t control weather!), and you could probably stand to crop out a bit of the sky. I like how the daffodils match the color of the bridge.</td>', 'I''m curious to know if the bridge really is yellow. Won''t affect the score, just curious. It''s a decent shot. There seems to be a lot of haze that''s obscuring most of the photo (I know you can''t control weather!), and you could probably stand to crop out a bit of the sky. I like how the daffodils match the color of the bridge.', '2006-04-03 17:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284322, 315089, 35645, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge nicely - I love that color yellow. The lighting on the right is a bit harsh, and overall there seems to be a very soft focus, which I''m not particularly fond of. In this case it almost looks like you were too close for your camera to focus properly rather than looking like the soft focus was a deliberate choice.</td>', 'Meets the challenge nicely - I love that color yellow. The lighting on the right is a bit harsh, and overall there seems to be a very soft focus, which I''m not particularly fond of. In this case it almost looks like you were too close for your camera to focus properly rather than looking like the soft focus was a deliberate choice.', '2006-04-03 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284326, 315155, 35645, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space. Interesting bug.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space. Interesting bug.', '2006-04-03 17:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284330, 313872, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bee (?) shot. Perfect focus. Love the contrast between the yellow and the reds.</td>', 'Beautiful bee (?) shot. Perfect focus. Love the contrast between the yellow and the reds.', '2006-04-03 17:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284341, 315474, 35645, '<td valign="top">This is good. Much better than the ones I was trying (before I gave up on this type of flower altogether!). Beautiful lighting, wonderful composition. After the challenge is over, I''d like to know what your lighting set-up is and how much of this is post processing. I''ve been trying to get shots like this and just am not quite there.</td>', 'This is good. Much better than the ones I was trying (before I gave up on this type of flower altogether!). Beautiful lighting, wonderful composition. After the challenge is over, I''d like to know what your lighting set-up is and how much of this is post processing. I''ve been trying to get shots like this and just am not quite there.', '2006-04-03 17:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284343, 315769, 35645, '<td valign="top">I get the concept, and the title describes it perfectly, but I honestly think this would look better with a different colored background.</td>', 'I get the concept, and the title describes it perfectly, but I honestly think this would look better with a different colored background.', '2006-04-03 17:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284346, 313343, 56307, '<td valign="top">The title states the true composition of the photograph!! "Balanced" <br/>Very soothing and a delight to look at!! Its yellow, and different. Well thought out!!</td>', 'The title states the true composition of the photograph!! "Balanced" Very soothing and a delight to look at!! Its yellow, and different. Well thought out!!', '2006-04-03 17:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284350, 315169, 35645, '<td valign="top">Is that cheese coming out of there?? Ew.<br/>(Nice choice of blue for the knife handle, by the way. And the composition is nice, too.)</td>', 'Is that cheese coming out of there?? Ew.(Nice choice of blue for the knife handle, by the way. And the composition is nice, too.)', '2006-04-03 17:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284353, 315382, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very neat. Creative. I like it.</td>', 'Very neat. Creative. I like it.', '2006-04-03 17:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284356, 313615, 35645, '<td valign="top">That''s a neat shot. Took me a minute to ''see'' the mirror. Cool.</td>', 'That''s a neat shot. Took me a minute to ''see'' the mirror. Cool.', '2006-04-03 17:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284358, 314703, 54755, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo... it''s well balanced.</td>', 'This is a great photo... it''s well balanced.', '2006-04-03 17:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284362, 315287, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love the lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful. Love the lighting.', '2006-04-03 17:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284367, 315218, 35645, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Stands out nicely from all the other daffodil shots.</td>', 'Very well done. Stands out nicely from all the other daffodil shots.', '2006-04-03 17:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284368, 315482, 24642, '<td valign="top">A great idea</td>', 'A great idea', '2006-04-03 17:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284371, 315482, 54755, '<td valign="top">Very clever, I love it!</td>', 'Very clever, I love it!', '2006-04-03 17:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284379, 315641, 35645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Crop feel a little tight, but beautiful nonetheless.</td>', 'Beautiful. Crop feel a little tight, but beautiful nonetheless.', '2006-04-03 17:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284383, 315817, 54755, '<td valign="top">Creative, very nice.</td>', 'Creative, very nice.', '2006-04-03 17:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284562, 314939, 36403, '<td valign="top">The side shadow is a little distracting, but nice composition &amp; colors. Very cute.</td>', 'The side shadow is a little distracting, but nice composition & colors. Very cute.', '2006-04-03 18:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284568, 315215, 36403, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  I like your choice of the blue background.  It compliments the yellow well.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  I like your choice of the blue background.  It compliments the yellow well.', '2006-04-03 19:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284571, 315154, 36403, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective &amp; DOF choice.</td>', 'Nice perspective & DOF choice.', '2006-04-03 19:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284573, 313925, 36403, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2006-04-03 19:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284576, 312695, 36403, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see the yellow a little brighter.  They don''t quite have that "POP" I think you were going for.  Nice choice for your background.</td>', 'Would have liked to see the yellow a little brighter.  They don''t quite have that "POP" I think you were going for.  Nice choice for your background.', '2006-04-03 19:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284578, 315810, 36403, '<td valign="top">Love this.  Very nice.</td>', 'Love this.  Very nice.', '2006-04-03 19:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284582, 315821, 36403, '<td valign="top">It definitely meets the yellow challenge, but to me thte background is too busy.</td>', 'It definitely meets the yellow challenge, but to me thte background is too busy.', '2006-04-03 19:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284583, 315593, 36403, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, clarity, &amp; DOF choice.</td>', 'Nice composition, clarity, & DOF choice.', '2006-04-03 19:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284585, 315690, 36403, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2006-04-03 19:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284586, 315117, 36403, '<td valign="top">Cool feather.  Nice framing.  Crease in the fabric is a bit distracting, but overall very nice.</td>', 'Cool feather.  Nice framing.  Crease in the fabric is a bit distracting, but overall very nice.', '2006-04-03 19:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284589, 315680, 36403, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  A nice change from flowers.  =)  Would have liked to see a little brighter yellow, but that''s just a personal preferance.  Good job.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  A nice change from flowers.  =)  Would have liked to see a little brighter yellow, but that''s just a personal preferance.  Good job.', '2006-04-03 19:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284590, 315809, 36403, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  Would have liked to see the whole thing in focus on this one, I think.</td>', 'Nice job.  Would have liked to see the whole thing in focus on this one, I think.', '2006-04-03 19:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284591, 313745, 36403, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2006-04-03 19:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284592, 315458, 36403, '<td valign="top">Nice crop.</td>', 'Nice crop.', '2006-04-03 19:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284596, 315827, 36403, '<td valign="top">Very refreshing photo.  =)  Nice job.</td>', 'Very refreshing photo.  =)  Nice job.', '2006-04-03 19:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284597, 313898, 36403, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting &amp; colors.  Would have liked to see more of the stem, or a tighter crop, maybe.</td>', 'Nice lighting & colors.  Would have liked to see more of the stem, or a tighter crop, maybe.', '2006-04-03 19:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284599, 312581, 36403, '<td valign="top">A little grainy.</td>', 'A little grainy.', '2006-04-03 19:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2284603, 315751, 36403, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but lacks that DPC "pop".</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but lacks that DPC "pop".', '2006-04-03 19:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
