(2285116, 315611, 43463, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully detailed capture of this cockatoo (I believe that this is a cockatoo but I maybe mistaken). one can see the fine details in it''s feather''s beak, and eye. The dark background really makes the yellow hues of this bird visually pop. That splash of orange in it''s feathery coat adds some interest and another strong vibrant color to the compostition. Square crop assists in keeping the eye''s attention focused on the main subject. My only critique is that because the bird does not rest in the center of the frame it creates an imbalance of negative space in the top right hand quandrant. There is more negative space in the background in the top right hand half than there is in the bottom left hand half.</td>', 'A wonderfully detailed capture of this cockatoo (I believe that this is a cockatoo but I maybe mistaken). one can see the fine details in it''s feather''s beak, and eye. The dark background really makes the yellow hues of this bird visually pop. That splash of orange in it''s feathery coat adds some interest and another strong vibrant color to the compostition. Square crop assists in keeping the eye''s attention focused on the main subject. My only critique is that because the bird does not rest in the center of the frame it creates an imbalance of negative space in the top right hand quandrant. There is more negative space in the background in the top right hand half than there is in the bottom left hand half.', '2006-04-03 23:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2285186, 314614, 1, '<td valign="top">I think the beige/brown background doesn''t help bring out the yellow cup cake... a better color background, I think, would''ve really made this image a hit.</td>', 'I think the beige/brown background doesn''t help bring out the yellow cup cake... a better color background, I think, would''ve really made this image a hit.', '2006-04-03 23:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
