(2285533, 313710, 40019, '<td valign="top">The title and sharpness on the ladybug suggest it was your subject, but the flower unfortunately over powers the image - not sure everyone is going to get it.  Nice image though - good luck!</td>', 'The title and sharpness on the ladybug suggest it was your subject, but the flower unfortunately over powers the image - not sure everyone is going to get it.  Nice image though - good luck!', '2006-04-04 02:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
