(2286132, 314967, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ohohoh, Can I go too?  I love to ride on bikes, all bikes!  Well, almost all bikes, not too fond of the 10-speed I crashed and burned on but that''s another story, LOL :)<br/> <br/>Back to you!  This is a lovely image, the use of shadow and light, the power and passion all played out in one shot.  Not to sure about the crop, I like the line leading in from the lower left corner, takes me into the lighted area, shows off the eagle and up to the controls of the power but then the crop on the bar leaves me just slightly off balance, but that can be a good thing too in  a shot like this because after riding a bike like this you should be slightly winded and off balance. :)  A great shot, a 9</td>', 'Ohohoh, Can I go too?  I love to ride on bikes, all bikes!  Well, almost all bikes, not too fond of the 10-speed I crashed and burned on but that''s another story, LOL :) Back to you!  This is a lovely image, the use of shadow and light, the power and passion all played out in one shot.  Not to sure about the crop, I like the line leading in from the lower left corner, takes me into the lighted area, shows off the eagle and up to the controls of the power but then the crop on the bar leaves me just slightly off balance, but that can be a good thing too in  a shot like this because after riding a bike like this you should be slightly winded and off balance. :)  A great shot, a 9', '2006-04-04 12:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2286134, 314809, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I like the lines, the message, the overall feel of the shot.  But the overall color or tone seems off just a tad, can''t quite place my finger on it, let me look another second here.......okay, figured it out, it''s the horizon on the right, the brightness is fighting the boat for attention but it''s not all bad, it leads me back out of the shot after the boat has led me in and taken me all around.  An 8</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I like the lines, the message, the overall feel of the shot.  But the overall color or tone seems off just a tad, can''t quite place my finger on it, let me look another second here.......okay, figured it out, it''s the horizon on the right, the brightness is fighting the boat for attention but it''s not all bad, it leads me back out of the shot after the boat has led me in and taken me all around.  An 8', '2006-04-04 12:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2286140, 313600, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yummy! That looks delicious!  Is that a splace on the top?  It''s hard to tell, almost missed it.  Lovely colors, the shadow is just muted enough not to distract but to add and the splash is a nice touch.  But there seems to be a yellow bubble or something on the top that bugs me because the splash is more white while the area it''s coming from is yellow and raised.  It keeps my attention, that''s for sure! ;)  An 8</td>', 'Yummy! That looks delicious!  Is that a splace on the top?  It''s hard to tell, almost missed it.  Lovely colors, the shadow is just muted enough not to distract but to add and the splash is a nice touch.  But there seems to be a yellow bubble or something on the top that bugs me because the splash is more white while the area it''s coming from is yellow and raised.  It keeps my attention, that''s for sure! ;)  An 8', '2006-04-04 12:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
