(2286558, 315671, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, the bold yellow and red with the touch of blue, but I can''t figure out exactly what I''m seeing, and I do not think either word in the title is actually a word in English. Please give some attention to your titles, a misspelled title makes a photo feel unprofessional. (If English is not your native language, that''s ok, use a dictionary for these all-important words.)</td>', 'I like the colors, the bold yellow and red with the touch of blue, but I can''t figure out exactly what I''m seeing, and I do not think either word in the title is actually a word in English. Please give some attention to your titles, a misspelled title makes a photo feel unprofessional. (If English is not your native language, that''s ok, use a dictionary for these all-important words.)', '2006-04-04 14:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2286569, 314498, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oooo, I like this, a little clock or watch would have made this perfect, LOL! :)<br/> <br/>Very well done, the mirror, the reflections, the color, all very nice.  A 9 (a watch would have gotten you a 10 ;p)</td>', 'Oooo, I like this, a little clock or watch would have made this perfect, LOL! :) Very well done, the mirror, the reflections, the color, all very nice.  A 9 (a watch would have gotten you a 10 ;p)', '2006-04-04 14:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2286576, 315686, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is so peaceful and lovely.  I love landscape shots with the ocean and water in them.  The boats are a nice touch to bring you back to the water and the sky is a very nice tone with the yellows and orange.  The balance between water, land and sky seems off just a touch in the balance.  It''s a little top heavy to me, but otherwise, very well done.  An 8</td>', 'This is so peaceful and lovely.  I love landscape shots with the ocean and water in them.  The boats are a nice touch to bring you back to the water and the sky is a very nice tone with the yellows and orange.  The balance between water, land and sky seems off just a touch in the balance.  It''s a little top heavy to me, but otherwise, very well done.  An 8', '2006-04-04 14:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2286580, 314966, 12448, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  Love the DOF on this one, the single petal left, is it love or is it not?  The color on the flower seems a bit dark to the petals in the background and the lines in the background, though muted and out of focus are just a touch (a very tiny touch) distracting to me.  But otherwise, creative, unique and wonderful!  An 8</td>', 'Sweet!  Love the DOF on this one, the single petal left, is it love or is it not?  The color on the flower seems a bit dark to the petals in the background and the lines in the background, though muted and out of focus are just a touch (a very tiny touch) distracting to me.  But otherwise, creative, unique and wonderful!  An 8', '2006-04-04 14:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2286582, 315386, 12448, '<td valign="top">Spring at last, Spring at last, too bad the wind is blowing outside my door and the temp is dropping, LOL :)  Just kidding.<br/> <br/>Very well done, nice colors, clarity and balance in the overall shot.  The stems are in good focus as well, wonder if they could be fuzzed just a bit to keep the eyes on the flowers but they look fine as they are also.  A very nice stock shot.  A 7</td>', 'Spring at last, Spring at last, too bad the wind is blowing outside my door and the temp is dropping, LOL :)  Just kidding. Very well done, nice colors, clarity and balance in the overall shot.  The stems are in good focus as well, wonder if they could be fuzzed just a bit to keep the eyes on the flowers but they look fine as they are also.  A very nice stock shot.  A 7', '2006-04-04 15:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2286588, 314147, 50695, '<td valign="top">the scorpion looks dead. I think the duck won.</td>', 'the scorpion looks dead. I think the duck won.', '2006-04-04 15:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2286589, 314487, 12448, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''m a bit wanting to lean or rotate this picture because of the clouds but I see the horizon is straight as are the boats. Very interesting effect.  Love the colors of the overall scene, very golden with the yellow on the top.  A very nice postcard scene. :)  An 8</td>', 'Okay, I''m a bit wanting to lean or rotate this picture because of the clouds but I see the horizon is straight as are the boats. Very interesting effect.  Love the colors of the overall scene, very golden with the yellow on the top.  A very nice postcard scene. :)  An 8', '2006-04-04 15:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
