(2287979, 314635, 44754, '<td valign="top">what office is this</td>', 'what office is this', '2006-04-05 00:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288007, 315482, 2134, '<td valign="top">this has got to be one of the cutest pictures I''ve seen!!!</td>', 'this has got to be one of the cutest pictures I''ve seen!!!', '2006-04-05 00:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288019, 315286, 75713, '<td valign="top">Wonderful contrast... perfectly focussed.... interesting angles... 8</td>', 'Wonderful contrast... perfectly focussed.... interesting angles... 8', '2006-04-05 00:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288031, 313710, 75713, '<td valign="top">an interesting concept... falls short however due to the lack of focus in the flower... the lady bug suits the title.. a long way to the top indeed...</td>', 'an interesting concept... falls short however due to the lack of focus in the flower... the lady bug suits the title.. a long way to the top indeed...', '2006-04-05 00:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288073, 315390, 75713, '<td valign="top">good job getting the bee on a yellow flower (they prefer blues, reds and purples) also, good job getting so much of the flower and the bee in focus..... one thing that might make this an even better shot would have been to increase the shutter speed to get more detail in the wing (but still keep a certain amount of blur) also, great title.</td>', 'good job getting the bee on a yellow flower (they prefer blues, reds and purples) also, good job getting so much of the flower and the bee in focus..... one thing that might make this an even better shot would have been to increase the shutter speed to get more detail in the wing (but still keep a certain amount of blur) also, great title.', '2006-04-05 01:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288085, 315635, 75713, '<td valign="top">the reflection in this shot is good.... the highlights appear blown and the rule of thirds would have improved your composition.. still, something about a little yellow duckie never loses appeal :)</td>', 'the reflection in this shot is good.... the highlights appear blown and the rule of thirds would have improved your composition.. still, something about a little yellow duckie never loses appeal :)', '2006-04-05 01:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288106, 314622, 75713, '<td valign="top">an original take on the challenge.. well photographed - not sure how you could make this a better shot - your composition is very good and I do appreciate abstracts which I consider this photo to be - this shot would also satisfy the texture challenge quite well.</td>', 'an original take on the challenge.. well photographed - not sure how you could make this a better shot - your composition is very good and I do appreciate abstracts which I consider this photo to be - this shot would also satisfy the texture challenge quite well.', '2006-04-05 01:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288132, 315375, 75713, '<td valign="top">the sky is very interesting.. i like the subtle gradient - the ship would have commanded more attention (from me) if it had not been so close to the center - I like the reflection in the water..... on my monitor the color of the ship is more orange than yellow</td>', 'the sky is very interesting.. i like the subtle gradient - the ship would have commanded more attention (from me) if it had not been so close to the center - I like the reflection in the water..... on my monitor the color of the ship is more orange than yellow', '2006-04-05 01:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288150, 313776, 75713, '<td valign="top">I like grids... this is an interesting take on the challenge... each little square has it''s own composition - two things that might improve this shot even more would be a crisper focus, and cropping it around the four by six grid of windows.</td>', 'I like grids... this is an interesting take on the challenge... each little square has it''s own composition - two things that might improve this shot even more would be a crisper focus, and cropping it around the four by six grid of windows.', '2006-04-05 01:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288151, 315168, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but a shallower depth of field concentrating on the main flower would help you out a lot here.</td>', 'Nice colors, but a shallower depth of field concentrating on the main flower would help you out a lot here.', '2006-04-05 01:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288162, 314966, 75713, '<td valign="top">I like the concept behind this shot.. but I do think that leaving more petals on the flower would have made a better composition - but it''s good she loves you :)</td>', 'I like the concept behind this shot.. but I do think that leaving more petals on the flower would have made a better composition - but it''s good she loves you :)', '2006-04-05 01:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288173, 315685, 75713, '<td valign="top">what a precious model.... and I do love baby hands... the chain over her head is distracting and having the focus point (the child) centered takes away from the composition</td>', 'what a precious model.... and I do love baby hands... the chain over her head is distracting and having the focus point (the child) centered takes away from the composition', '2006-04-05 01:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288175, 315307, 48717, '<td valign="top">Just browsing, not voting yet...but I love this one!  I am sure it will be one of my tops.</td>', 'Just browsing, not voting yet...but I love this one!  I am sure it will be one of my tops.', '2006-04-05 01:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288186, 315656, 75713, '<td valign="top">very nice, well photographed abstract... on my monitor it appears orange however... the lighting is very good and I like the shadows</td>', 'very nice, well photographed abstract... on my monitor it appears orange however... the lighting is very good and I like the shadows', '2006-04-05 01:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288208, 315637, 75713, '<td valign="top">in this case, centering the subject works..... the background is a stroke of genius.. it really compliments the models color... the only change that would encourage me to give a higher score would be if the models ''hair'' was more yellow - an overall great shot!   7</td>', 'in this case, centering the subject works..... the background is a stroke of genius.. it really compliments the models color... the only change that would encourage me to give a higher score would be if the models ''hair'' was more yellow - an overall great shot!   7', '2006-04-05 01:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288223, 314327, 75713, '<td valign="top">ok, this is nasty..... it''s late.. dinner is only a memory and I am hungry :)  the structure in this shot works.. the only thing that might have improved this shot would be a darker background - the white seems to desaturate the yellows.</td>', 'ok, this is nasty..... it''s late.. dinner is only a memory and I am hungry :)  the structure in this shot works.. the only thing that might have improved this shot would be a darker background - the white seems to desaturate the yellows.', '2006-04-05 01:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288246, 313445, 75713, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful shot..... well photographed - the flowers have an overall orange cast.. with advanced editing available, adding more yellow to the flowers might have been a good idea</td>', 'this is a beautiful shot..... well photographed - the flowers have an overall orange cast.. with advanced editing available, adding more yellow to the flowers might have been a good idea', '2006-04-05 01:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288257, 314979, 75713, '<td valign="top">this is most yellow, suits the challenge... and you did a good job of highlighting the textures .... for me, the composition does not really grab my attention.</td>', 'this is most yellow, suits the challenge... and you did a good job of highlighting the textures .... for me, the composition does not really grab my attention.', '2006-04-05 01:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288270, 314850, 46601, '<td valign="top">great idea ... good shot ... but there is something just above the tip of the paint brush that I find very distracting</td>', 'great idea ... good shot ... but there is something just above the tip of the paint brush that I find very distracting', '2006-04-05 01:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2288275, 315642, 75713, '<td valign="top">exquisite - one of the best in this composition..... crisp focus..... you resisted over-saturating the yellows, leaving them realistic and subtle.. well done! 9</td>', 'exquisite - one of the best in this composition..... crisp focus..... you resisted over-saturating the yellows, leaving them realistic and subtle.. well done! 9', '2006-04-05 01:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
