(2288290, 315783, 75713, '<td valign="top">humor is always welcomed (by me anyway) ...... well photographed and a good composition... do you really keep your vacuum cleaner that clean?? (hang my head in shame here)</td>', 'humor is always welcomed (by me anyway) ...... well photographed and a good composition... do you really keep your vacuum cleaner that clean?? (hang my head in shame here)', '2006-04-05 02:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
