(2289701, 314399, 40718, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, but I wish the focus was on its eye or tongue and not the tip of his nose.  It''s so easy to do this with autofocus.  The camera loves to pick that spot.</td>', 'Neat shot, but I wish the focus was on its eye or tongue and not the tip of his nose.  It''s so easy to do this with autofocus.  The camera loves to pick that spot.', '2006-04-05 14:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
