(2292136, 314481, 37103, '<td valign="top">I love that you went out and found a beautiful field of yellow flowers. If you could have taken the photo is such a way that you could see the lines the rows made a little more clearly I think it would keep my attention a little longer.  Still a beautiful subject.</td>', 'I love that you went out and found a beautiful field of yellow flowers. If you could have taken the photo is such a way that you could see the lines the rows made a little more clearly I think it would keep my attention a little longer.  Still a beautiful subject.', '2006-04-06 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
