(2292476, 315723, 39349, '<td valign="top">Too much neat image/gaussian blur on the bird, seems to be a halo around it as well. My eye keeps getting drawn to the birds feet as they are in sharp focus. Not sure about the yellow border either. Composition is good and over all the shot has and interest that pulls the view in, with some minor changes I think you''ll have a beautiful shot.</td>', 'Too much neat image/gaussian blur on the bird, seems to be a halo around it as well. My eye keeps getting drawn to the birds feet as they are in sharp focus. Not sure about the yellow border either. Composition is good and over all the shot has and interest that pulls the view in, with some minor changes I think you''ll have a beautiful shot.', '2006-04-06 17:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
