(2295504, 312592, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing Ursula?  If not, take it as a compliment.  Well done!</td>', 'I''m guessing Ursula?  If not, take it as a compliment.  Well done!', '2006-04-07 16:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295514, 312546, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect title!  The only thing that kinda bothers me about this otherwise realy cute, well-composed and sharp picture is the dark background at the top.  It just doesn''t seem "natural" for some reason.</td>', 'Perfect title!  The only thing that kinda bothers me about this otherwise realy cute, well-composed and sharp picture is the dark background at the top.  It just doesn''t seem "natural" for some reason.', '2006-04-07 16:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2295531, 314681, 30896, '<td valign="top">I not sure about the composition - I would keep it all yellow without red and green eggs in the corner, plus the negative space on the right makes the photo kind of shifted imho... but having said that, it''s still lovely and editing on the duckling seems perfect</td>', 'I not sure about the composition - I would keep it all yellow without red and green eggs in the corner, plus the negative space on the right makes the photo kind of shifted imho... but having said that, it''s still lovely and editing on the duckling seems perfect', '2006-04-07 16:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
