(2297802, 312592, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the warm yellows and the pastel background colors.  A unique view of the flower with just the tips of the petals towards the camera and in focus.  One of my top picks from the challenge!  Well done! :)</td>', 'Love the warm yellows and the pastel background colors.  A unique view of the flower with just the tips of the petals towards the camera and in focus.  One of my top picks from the challenge!  Well done! :)', '2006-04-08 15:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
