(2300338, 315580, 37961, '<td valign="top">Ursula? If not, you did a sensational job of this. Lots of Wow.</td>', 'Ursula? If not, you did a sensational job of this. Lots of Wow.', '2006-04-10 00:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
