(2300672, 315372, 50641, '<td valign="top">Wow I really expected this to score much higher. (Silly me.)  A terrific photo and a wonderful answer to the challenge.</td>', 'Wow I really expected this to score much higher. (Silly me.)  A terrific photo and a wonderful answer to the challenge.', '2006-04-10 02:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300675, 313868, 47487, '<td valign="top">The colors are perhaps a wee bit flat and I wish I could see more detail in the carnations. It''s also a little noisy, especially in the green. Perhaps that''s a camera thing for you, as I notice that you ran noise reduction. I didn''t come upon this in the voting, but if I had I''d probably have given it a 5 -- in focus, meets challenge, average image, with slightly flat lighting.<br/> <br/>I do really like the composition, though.</td>', 'The colors are perhaps a wee bit flat and I wish I could see more detail in the carnations. It''s also a little noisy, especially in the green. Perhaps that''s a camera thing for you, as I notice that you ran noise reduction. I didn''t come upon this in the voting, but if I had I''d probably have given it a 5 -- in focus, meets challenge, average image, with slightly flat lighting. I do really like the composition, though.', '2006-04-10 02:10:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300678, 314363, 47487, '<td valign="top">I think that''s a really nice shot, and I''ve no idea why it didn''t score better. Not that 5.4 is *bad*, but I''d have figured on this one being more in the 5.7ish range. About the only thing I could think to improve it would be a vertical crop but that''s just me.</td>', 'I think that''s a really nice shot, and I''ve no idea why it didn''t score better. Not that 5.4 is *bad*, but I''d have figured on this one being more in the 5.7ish range. About the only thing I could think to improve it would be a vertical crop but that''s just me.', '2006-04-10 02:12:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300683, 313276, 47487, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I can see it''s been done a lot, but 5.0? That seems lower than it should be. This is sharp, has good ''pop'', is nicely saturated. The only things it has going against it are the slight curve in the top dividing line and the fact that we''ve seen it done a lot. Not enough to lower the score to where it was in my opinion. Nice shot.</td>', 'Yeah, I can see it''s been done a lot, but 5.0? That seems lower than it should be. This is sharp, has good ''pop'', is nicely saturated. The only things it has going against it are the slight curve in the top dividing line and the fact that we''ve seen it done a lot. Not enough to lower the score to where it was in my opinion. Nice shot.', '2006-04-10 02:14:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300687, 312848, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and especially nice composition. DPCers don''t tend to rate family pictures very high, but this is a great one for the album, I think. It captures a nice moment in an artistic way. Even though I loathe Sponge Bob. :)</td>', 'Nice lighting, and especially nice composition. DPCers don''t tend to rate family pictures very high, but this is a great one for the album, I think. It captures a nice moment in an artistic way. Even though I loathe Sponge Bob. :)', '2006-04-10 02:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300691, 315648, 47487, '<td valign="top">The background is noisy and somehow the purple looks a bit overprocessed to me. Other than that, good composition, nice choice of subject (although I think you probably suffered from low scores simply because there were SO MANY flowers in this challenge, including mine, which suffered similarly). I like the detail in the flower''s center.</td>', 'The background is noisy and somehow the purple looks a bit overprocessed to me. Other than that, good composition, nice choice of subject (although I think you probably suffered from low scores simply because there were SO MANY flowers in this challenge, including mine, which suffered similarly). I like the detail in the flower''s center.', '2006-04-10 02:18:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300693, 313713, 50231, '<td valign="top">Congrats Dude. Great Image!</td>', 'Congrats Dude. Great Image!', '2006-04-10 02:19:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300695, 313900, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. What an ugly bridge, lol -- but nice of them to fix it for you just in time for the challenge. Overall this is a good shot.</td>', 'Nice composition. What an ugly bridge, lol -- but nice of them to fix it for you just in time for the challenge. Overall this is a good shot.', '2006-04-10 02:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300696, 315307, 11793, '<td valign="top">BANG - awesome - congrats !<br/></td>', 'BANG - awesome - congrats !', '2006-04-10 02:21:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300698, 315565, 47487, '<td valign="top">I like this. Somehow the dark lines look a little grainy, but I don''t know if that''s the fabric or the photograph. This has a nice abstract feel to it, even though like the other commenter I don''t know the significance of the yellow rose.</td>', 'I like this. Somehow the dark lines look a little grainy, but I don''t know if that''s the fabric or the photograph. This has a nice abstract feel to it, even though like the other commenter I don''t know the significance of the yellow rose.', '2006-04-10 02:21:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300702, 315333, 47487, '<td valign="top">That''s funny. :) I think compositionally I''d have liked it better if I could have seen the cow''s legs and hooves entirely, but you can''t go bossing them around, I suppose. :) Otherwise very nicely done.</td>', 'That''s funny. :) I think compositionally I''d have liked it better if I could have seen the cow''s legs and hooves entirely, but you can''t go bossing them around, I suppose. :) Otherwise very nicely done.', '2006-04-10 02:23:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300704, 315649, 47487, '<td valign="top">Eew, peeps, nasty.<br/> <br/>Now that I have that out of the way, I think this should have done better than it did. This is why I am always entering pictures that I think should do better than they do, I suppose, but hey. *I* like it.</td>', 'Eew, peeps, nasty. Now that I have that out of the way, I think this should have done better than it did. This is why I am always entering pictures that I think should do better than they do, I suppose, but hey. *I* like it.', '2006-04-10 02:25:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300722, 315465, 41337, '<td valign="top">I could see why you said it might do well or tank. Regardless of how it actually went it''s a good image. I think the polarizer made the shot for the voters.</td>', 'I could see why you said it might do well or tank. Regardless of how it actually went it''s a good image. I think the polarizer made the shot for the voters.', '2006-04-10 02:33:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300739, 314363, 30982, '<td valign="top">In addition to liking the title, I thought the image was strangely sensual.  I also like how you''re created the distance to each of the other lamps.  Now how did you do it??</td>', 'In addition to liking the title, I thought the image was strangely sensual.  I also like how you''re created the distance to each of the other lamps.  Now how did you do it??', '2006-04-10 02:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
