(2300923, 315465, 47294, '<td valign="top">Well done mate, a great photo with striking colours!!  If we can keep up this standard of scoring we will be one hard team to beat.  <b>VIVA LA PENTAX!!!!</b></td>', 'Well done mate, a great photo with striking colours!!  If we can keep up this standard of scoring we will be one hard team to beat.  VIVA LA PENTAX!!!!', '2006-04-10 04:30:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300927, 314363, 50551, '<td valign="top">This is some shot, especially in terms of its difference! I like the overall composition and the way in which the lava lamps suggest an other worldly sensation. Personally - and what do I know? - I would have positioned the left hand lamp differently, probably higher with the righ hand lamp a little lower, just to drive the dynamics of the picture. A very clever image none the less.</td>', 'This is some shot, especially in terms of its difference! I like the overall composition and the way in which the lava lamps suggest an other worldly sensation. Personally - and what do I know? - I would have positioned the left hand lamp differently, probably higher with the righ hand lamp a little lower, just to drive the dynamics of the picture. A very clever image none the less.', '2006-04-10 04:31:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300934, 313900, 47294, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, well done mate!  My favorite elements in this shot are the sky and the leafless tree, makes for a strong contrast with the yellow of the bridge.<br/> <br/><b>VIVA LA PENTAX!!!</b></td>', 'Nice shot, well done mate!  My favorite elements in this shot are the sky and the leafless tree, makes for a strong contrast with the yellow of the bridge. VIVA LA PENTAX!!!', '2006-04-10 04:34:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300939, 313868, 50551, '<td valign="top">Strong composition and well within the challenge definition. The colours are a bit flat - the yellow in the carnations seems too weak - and there is some noise in there as well. Personally I would have tightened the top vertical crop to give more of a 1/3 black, 2/3 yellow in the background but then again - <i>caveat emptor</i>!<br/> <br/>I also think it would have been slightly stronger if the yellow saturations had been reversed - more intense on the carnations and less on the lower background.<br/> <br/>Liked the image a lot.</td>', 'Strong composition and well within the challenge definition. The colours are a bit flat - the yellow in the carnations seems too weak - and there is some noise in there as well. Personally I would have tightened the top vertical crop to give more of a 1/3 black, 2/3 yellow in the background but then again - caveat emptor! I also think it would have been slightly stronger if the yellow saturations had been reversed - more intense on the carnations and less on the lower background. Liked the image a lot.', '2006-04-10 04:36:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2300942, 315307, 14386, '<td valign="top">BIG congrats.  I am here in an internet cafe in my homeprovince of Iloilo, the Philippines and I would like to drop a line an d say...THIS IS REALLY AWESOME!<br/></td>', 'BIG congrats.  I am here in an internet cafe in my homeprovince of Iloilo, the Philippines and I would like to drop a line an d say...THIS IS REALLY AWESOME!', '2006-04-10 04:37:45.000000', NULL, 0),
