(2300970, 315333, 50551, '<td valign="top">This is my kind of picture - off the wall and with humour too! While I can see that editing out the grey weeds would help - also seems to be some other curious artefacts in there as well - I think this great image suffers from the dpc "humour is not funny" syndrome. Personally, I love it!</td>', 'This is my kind of picture - off the wall and with humour too! While I can see that editing out the grey weeds would help - also seems to be some other curious artefacts in there as well - I think this great image suffers from the dpc "humour is not funny" syndrome. Personally, I love it!', '2006-04-10 04:52:28.000000', NULL, 0),
