(2301057, 314025, 23458, '<td valign="top">Well I can''t believe you bought a duck specifically for a dpc challenge... that''s what I call dedication!<br/> <br/>On the other hand it''s a terrific shot - those polished floors seem to serve you very well in challenges here. I''d think about cloning out the reflection of the duck from the floor, but otherwise there''s not much I''d change here.</td>', 'Well I can''t believe you bought a duck specifically for a dpc challenge... that''s what I call dedication! On the other hand it''s a terrific shot - those polished floors seem to serve you very well in challenges here. I''d think about cloning out the reflection of the duck from the floor, but otherwise there''s not much I''d change here.', '2006-04-10 06:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
