(2301172, 315186, 7889, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comment :-)<br/> <br/>I did not expect this to do very well so I am not dissapointed!<br/> <br/>It''s magnetic letters stuck on the fridge they have no meaning as they were the only yellow ones I could find, of course once I had finished and uploaded it I found loads more yellow letters in my grandsons toy box but I just left it, too much trouble to start again!<br/> <br/>thanks again<br/>mike<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for your comment :-) I did not expect this to do very well so I am not dissapointed! It''s magnetic letters stuck on the fridge they have no meaning as they were the only yellow ones I could find, of course once I had finished and uploaded it I found loads more yellow letters in my grandsons toy box but I just left it, too much trouble to start again! thanks againmike ', '2006-04-10 09:00:49.000000', NULL, 0),
