(2301198, 315009, 36499, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot other than the ground and girls being somewhat dark. I would try lassoing both and doing a levels adjustment and maybe play with the selective color a bit, make the yellow really pop out. hope this helps...top 100 isnt a bad place to finishe considering the competition for this challenge :o)<br/> <br/>~~Cher~~</td>', 'I think this is a great shot other than the ground and girls being somewhat dark. I would try lassoing both and doing a levels adjustment and maybe play with the selective color a bit, make the yellow really pop out. hope this helps...top 100 isnt a bad place to finishe considering the competition for this challenge :o) ~~Cher~~', '2006-04-10 09:27:30.000000', NULL, 0),
