(2301332, 314411, 50674, '<td valign="top">Highway-robbery, this shot deserved to be among the top ten. I came back to look for it, couldn''t believe that I had to scroll through 75% to find it. DPC''ers are a strange lot.</td>', 'Highway-robbery, this shot deserved to be among the top ten. I came back to look for it, couldn''t believe that I had to scroll through 75% to find it. DPC''ers are a strange lot.', '2006-04-10 10:39:12.000000', NULL, 0),
