(2301534, 315313, 47487, '<td valign="top">This is a cute idea, prettily composed, and well-shot. It''s nice and sharp. I honestly think it would have done fine without the pink in it; I actually had to go back and look for it once I saw the title.<br/> <br/>The delineation between the subject and the foreground (white) seems a little harsh. While I am not an advocate of the tilt gimmick, I don''t think this shot is hurt by it.</td>', 'This is a cute idea, prettily composed, and well-shot. It''s nice and sharp. I honestly think it would have done fine without the pink in it; I actually had to go back and look for it once I saw the title. The delineation between the subject and the foreground (white) seems a little harsh. While I am not an advocate of the tilt gimmick, I don''t think this shot is hurt by it.', '2006-04-10 12:26:26.000000', NULL, 0),
