(2302015, 313708, 10858, '<td valign="top">So wonderful lighting, shades and details, I have to share giega''s opinion: man, you are robbed. This is a top quality photo, yes, a sad moody, but you can''t be happy all the time, can you? And the fact that daffos are the symbols of happiness and spring, this deepens the dramatic influence on me. This is a fine photo and I would have voted 9 for it, but as I am not a member yet.<br/> <br/>Don''t be upset, it''s not only you who doesn''t understand it. It''s almaost the same with my Children''s toy entry, 2 comments yet, both very helpful and noble, but I can''t beleive that it''s not interesting enough for anyone else to leave a comment.</td>', 'So wonderful lighting, shades and details, I have to share giega''s opinion: man, you are robbed. This is a top quality photo, yes, a sad moody, but you can''t be happy all the time, can you? And the fact that daffos are the symbols of happiness and spring, this deepens the dramatic influence on me. This is a fine photo and I would have voted 9 for it, but as I am not a member yet. Don''t be upset, it''s not only you who doesn''t understand it. It''s almaost the same with my Children''s toy entry, 2 comments yet, both very helpful and noble, but I can''t beleive that it''s not interesting enough for anyone else to leave a comment.', '2006-04-10 16:36:01.000000', NULL, 0),
