(2302417, 313288, 27482, '<td valign="top">For starters, it would have scored much better if it were in focus, I can´t imagine there being motion blur since it´s at 1/800 of a second.  Also the shot doesn´t connect with me, I don´t get what is going on, needs a backround or something to show the environment.  What I mean is, is she slipping, is she jumping up in the air, is someone throwing the flowers at her, you can´t really make any of that out from viewing the shot.  I know that comes from the title but it shouldn´t have to, the shot should tell the whole story.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps :)</td>', 'For starters, it would have scored much better if it were in focus, I can´t imagine there being motion blur since it´s at 1/800 of a second.  Also the shot doesn´t connect with me, I don´t get what is going on, needs a backround or something to show the environment.  What I mean is, is she slipping, is she jumping up in the air, is someone throwing the flowers at her, you can´t really make any of that out from viewing the shot.  I know that comes from the title but it shouldn´t have to, the shot should tell the whole story. Hope this helps :)', '2006-04-10 20:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
