(2310576, 313867, 39110, '<td valign="top">Thanks for my only comment Deannda and the 8 :) no I just have a point and shoot so I got up real close to my cat, all my cats are pretty good abouit it! The red line down the side is a vein and funnily enough my nine year old''s critique was to get rid of it too! Maybe I should have listened to her!</td>', 'Thanks for my only comment Deannda and the 8 :) no I just have a point and shoot so I got up real close to my cat, all my cats are pretty good abouit it! The red line down the side is a vein and funnily enough my nine year old''s critique was to get rid of it too! Maybe I should have listened to her!', '2006-04-13 17:40:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2311045, 314363, 46468, '<td valign="top">Really like the idea, wish the focus was tighter on the smaller image also, and maybe that one a little higher, but do understand you have to work with what you have. Overall nicely done</td>', 'Really like the idea, wish the focus was tighter on the smaller image also, and maybe that one a little higher, but do understand you have to work with what you have. Overall nicely done', '2006-04-13 22:04:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2311050, 313276, 46468, '<td valign="top">I like the effect you created, and the colors work very well together, but in my opinion there really isn''t any yellow, looks more like orange and red to me. I think if the lighter color had been a really strong bright lemon yellow you would have scored much higher.</td>', 'I like the effect you created, and the colors work very well together, but in my opinion there really isn''t any yellow, looks more like orange and red to me. I think if the lighter color had been a really strong bright lemon yellow you would have scored much higher.', '2006-04-13 22:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2311124, 312848, 46468, '<td valign="top">Cute expression!!! SpongeBob is a hit with lots of people, not just the little ones either, I know a few in the late twenties to early thirties that love him. I too think a tighter crop on the left side would have worked a little better, as it stands I find my eyes traveling to that large empty space expecting to see something, which of course pulls my eyes off your cute subject. One other thing, seeing only a portion of his hands distracts me, maybe cropped right at the bottom of the shirt would have worked as the hand on the right side of the picture seems a wee bit soft. Overall cute and definately has yellow</td>', 'Cute expression!!! SpongeBob is a hit with lots of people, not just the little ones either, I know a few in the late twenties to early thirties that love him. I too think a tighter crop on the left side would have worked a little better, as it stands I find my eyes traveling to that large empty space expecting to see something, which of course pulls my eyes off your cute subject. One other thing, seeing only a portion of his hands distracts me, maybe cropped right at the bottom of the shirt would have worked as the hand on the right side of the picture seems a wee bit soft. Overall cute and definately has yellow', '2006-04-13 22:31:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2311140, 313900, 46468, '<td valign="top">Definately yellow!! Fits the challenge well. Have to admit that I also saw your outtakes before commenting here and I do think it helps with the bridge a little lower to be more on the bottom thirds. Definately like the sky better in this one though, overall nicely done.</td>', 'Definately yellow!! Fits the challenge well. Have to admit that I also saw your outtakes before commenting here and I do think it helps with the bridge a little lower to be more on the bottom thirds. Definately like the sky better in this one though, overall nicely done.', '2006-04-13 22:39:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2311160, 315565, 46468, '<td valign="top">Really like this image, love Lance, the rose adds a really great contrast from the bold STRONG. Not sure how you could have improved the image, maybe a little different lighting, but not really sure. Really little thing, but the zipper bugs me, wish it ended in the dark line above instead of cutting the "T" that way, but maybe the line of the closed zipper through the "T" was more distracting. Overall really like this one, well done</td>', 'Really like this image, love Lance, the rose adds a really great contrast from the bold STRONG. Not sure how you could have improved the image, maybe a little different lighting, but not really sure. Really little thing, but the zipper bugs me, wish it ended in the dark line above instead of cutting the "T" that way, but maybe the line of the closed zipper through the "T" was more distracting. Overall really like this one, well done', '2006-04-13 22:52:58.000000', NULL, 0),
