(2315291, 315333, 46468, '<td valign="top">Imaginitive photo! I like the idea but wish that you had been able to get all the little white areas yellow, I think that would have increased your score a lot. A tighter crop make have worked a little better also, maybe putting the whole cow on the thirds, or really tight crop with the eye and head in the top thirds, either way a fun photo with lots of creativity.</td>', 'Imaginitive photo! I like the idea but wish that you had been able to get all the little white areas yellow, I think that would have increased your score a lot. A tighter crop make have worked a little better also, maybe putting the whole cow on the thirds, or really tight crop with the eye and head in the top thirds, either way a fun photo with lots of creativity.', '2006-04-16 00:42:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2315307, 315649, 46468, '<td valign="top">I actually bought some peeps but couldn''t figure out what to do with them. I like the concept here, but would have preferred to see more of the peeps, like held more upright maybe. Love the spots of sugar on the lips, think it adds to the photo. The red fingernail suggestion might have been nice too, just to add a little more color.</td>', 'I actually bought some peeps but couldn''t figure out what to do with them. I like the concept here, but would have preferred to see more of the peeps, like held more upright maybe. Love the spots of sugar on the lips, think it adds to the photo. The red fingernail suggestion might have been nice too, just to add a little more color.', '2006-04-16 00:47:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2315330, 315107, 46468, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, love the drops of water, and overall a really nice picture. I agree that just a little bit brighter yellow probably would have jumped the score up a wee bit more. I also would have preferred to see the ends of all the petals, but that is just my personal opinion.</td>', 'Like the idea, love the drops of water, and overall a really nice picture. I agree that just a little bit brighter yellow probably would have jumped the score up a wee bit more. I also would have preferred to see the ends of all the petals, but that is just my personal opinion.', '2006-04-16 00:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2315341, 315313, 46468, '<td valign="top">Really cute idea, like the composition, the angle really adds some interest.  Like how you included the pink flower to give it a little contrast.  I wish the pot had not been so reflective and maybe just a wee bit sharper would have helped too. Overall nicely done.</td>', 'Really cute idea, like the composition, the angle really adds some interest.  Like how you included the pink flower to give it a little contrast.  I wish the pot had not been so reflective and maybe just a wee bit sharper would have helped too. Overall nicely done.', '2006-04-16 00:59:29.000000', NULL, 0),
