(2324289, 315684, 57537, '<td valign="top">i think thi is a wonderful image. the only thing i dont like is that her face is chopped off. thank-you for sharing it regardless.</td>', 'i think thi is a wonderful image. the only thing i dont like is that her face is chopped off. thank-you for sharing it regardless.', '2006-04-19 03:25:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2324896, 313446, 25355, '<td valign="top">It''s quite surreal, though the background really detracts from the subject (especially with those streaks pointing into the flower). I didn''t reach this one in voting but I would have given it at least 7.</td>', 'It''s quite surreal, though the background really detracts from the subject (especially with those streaks pointing into the flower). I didn''t reach this one in voting but I would have given it at least 7.', '2006-04-19 07:45:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326971, 315487, 14414, '<td valign="top">I think the very shallow dof would work more effectively with a tighter crop, because as it is, the entire right half is oof, and the sharpest part, on the stamens, is bang on centre. Its difficult with daffodils, ''cause they can get kinda boring close up, just lots of yellow but maybe you could give it something else by harsher lighting, to bring out the textures<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-20 12:31:04.</i></td>', 'I think the very shallow dof would work more effectively with a tighter crop, because as it is, the entire right half is oof, and the sharpest part, on the stamens, is bang on centre. Its difficult with daffodils, ''cause they can get kinda boring close up, just lots of yellow but maybe you could give it something else by harsher lighting, to bring out the textures', '2006-04-19 19:07:02.000000', '2006-04-20 13:31:04.000000', 0),
