(2338909, 315458, 48228, '<td valign="top">I also Love this image in the challenge, and felt it deserved a much higher score. Keep up the good work.....</td>', 'I also Love this image in the challenge, and felt it deserved a much higher score. Keep up the good work.....', '2006-04-24 11:24:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2341352, 314363, 53147, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot. To make it better - hmmm - maybe cloneout some of the specs within the lamps to make it a bit cleaner and maybe a tighter crop on the sides. I love how the lamps just look like they are floating out there. And I think you took the shot atthe right time during the lamp cycle. Later on the lava would be in too many pieces and have a different effect. This has a cool feel about it. Very nice.</td>', 'I liked this shot. To make it better - hmmm - maybe cloneout some of the specs within the lamps to make it a bit cleaner and maybe a tighter crop on the sides. I love how the lamps just look like they are floating out there. And I think you took the shot atthe right time during the lamp cycle. Later on the lava would be in too many pieces and have a different effect. This has a cool feel about it. Very nice.', '2006-04-25 08:16:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2341371, 314635, 53147, '<td valign="top">Thought this would have been higher than it was. Good shot with nice lines (and curves). Well done.</td>', 'Thought this would have been higher than it was. Good shot with nice lines (and curves). Well done.', '2006-04-25 08:29:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2341406, 315333, 53147, '<td valign="top">Funny shot. Bringing out the greens a bit more may have made the cow pop better (not that you want a cow to pop mind you - that would be a mess). Not much else I can add to make it better oustide of completeing out the yellow on the cow.</td>', 'Funny shot. Bringing out the greens a bit more may have made the cow pop better (not that you want a cow to pop mind you - that would be a mess). Not much else I can add to make it better oustide of completeing out the yellow on the cow.', '2006-04-25 08:57:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2341876, 312708, 50631, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Great image!</td>', 'Great idea! Great image!', '2006-04-25 11:29:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2343497, 314769, 30982, '<td valign="top">A highly underrated picture I''d love to see in a larger size.  And bleh to those who disliked the border.  That''s what made this picture, imho.</td>', 'A highly underrated picture I''d love to see in a larger size.  And bleh to those who disliked the border.  That''s what made this picture, imho.', '2006-04-25 22:43:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2343636, 314093, 43148, '<td valign="top">From one who is wishing for a 5.5 now, LOL, nice photo, but to me the wow/pop factor is missing. Looks too real for most of the voters here (my opinion, only)!! The post processing did not leave this with the "electric blue" or deep golds that seem to be the only way to score well with a sunrise/sunset photo!  I like it, wish the angle had put more lake, less trees in background, but that is a personal thing! <br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'From one who is wishing for a 5.5 now, LOL, nice photo, but to me the wow/pop factor is missing. Looks too real for most of the voters here (my opinion, only)!! The post processing did not leave this with the "electric blue" or deep golds that seem to be the only way to score well with a sunrise/sunset photo!  I like it, wish the angle had put more lake, less trees in background, but that is a personal thing!  Jacque', '2006-04-25 23:24:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2347103, 315107, 47631, '<td valign="top">I like the water drops! Nice close up</td>', 'I like the water drops! Nice close up', '2006-04-26 16:11:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2349232, 315150, 30861, '<td valign="top">I was checking out your profile following up on the milestone thread, and realized this was your image. I believe this is a surprisingly low score; I had this image ranked in my top 10 and had given it an 8. I think it''s quite lovely, and I admire the unabashed way you celebrate the common textures of the Background and foreground cloths.<br/> <br/>Oddly enough I put some daffodils in "Something New", and they did pretty well. But of course mine are in the field, not a still life.<br/> <br/>Congrats on your milestone!</td>', 'I was checking out your profile following up on the milestone thread, and realized this was your image. I believe this is a surprisingly low score; I had this image ranked in my top 10 and had given it an 8. I think it''s quite lovely, and I admire the unabashed way you celebrate the common textures of the Background and foreground cloths. Oddly enough I put some daffodils in "Something New", and they did pretty well. But of course mine are in the field, not a still life. Congrats on your milestone!', '2006-04-27 00:52:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2353837, 314790, 48115, '<td valign="top">undrerated! Unbilivable shot and very good prosessing..</td>', 'undrerated! Unbilivable shot and very good prosessing..', '2006-04-28 16:50:49.000000', NULL, 0),
