(2485768, 314316, 27767, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m actually surprised at the score this received. There appears to be a slight diffusion applied to the image, and I think that adds interest. I love the strong bright colors and I think the composition is perfect. The blue sky makes such a nice contrast to the bright yellow of the subject. I think the lighting is nice to bring out both the strong colors. Focus looks perfect too. I guess this shot just shows how here at DPC even a technically excellent photo can draw just an average score. I''d expect this shot to score a 6+ without breaking a sweat.</td>', 'Wow, I''m actually surprised at the score this received. There appears to be a slight diffusion applied to the image, and I think that adds interest. I love the strong bright colors and I think the composition is perfect. The blue sky makes such a nice contrast to the bright yellow of the subject. I think the lighting is nice to bring out both the strong colors. Focus looks perfect too. I guess this shot just shows how here at DPC even a technically excellent photo can draw just an average score. I''d expect this shot to score a 6+ without breaking a sweat.', '2006-06-05 06:49:54.000000', NULL, 0),
