(2674541, 315725, 52336, '<td valign="top">In response to your request for a comment on this photograph: <br/> <br/>Very neat dramatic image, the highlight of which for me is the graffiti.  Without considering your title, it adds a bit of mystery to the whole thing that makes me want to look more.  I like the frame-up, and the angle splits it into interesting shapes via the bridge, wall, and various other structures.  About the post-processing, I think the burning you''ve apparently done is well executed, but the haloing, resulting from sharpening, as well as, possibly, a lighter touch to the burning in certain areas, gives the whole thing away.  This would be at the top of the gates, and at the bridge.  Otherwise a cool photograph, well done.</td>', 'In response to your request for a comment on this photograph:  Very neat dramatic image, the highlight of which for me is the graffiti.  Without considering your title, it adds a bit of mystery to the whole thing that makes me want to look more.  I like the frame-up, and the angle splits it into interesting shapes via the bridge, wall, and various other structures.  About the post-processing, I think the burning you''ve apparently done is well executed, but the haloing, resulting from sharpening, as well as, possibly, a lighter touch to the burning in certain areas, gives the whole thing away.  This would be at the top of the gates, and at the bridge.  Otherwise a cool photograph, well done.', '2006-07-29 18:31:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2699752, 315504, 21714, '<td valign="top">Ah! :) So this is the one. <br/>Nice idea. Cool.</td>', 'Ah! :) So this is the one. Nice idea. Cool.', '2006-08-06 17:56:49.000000', NULL, 0),
