(2713072, 315744, 43753, '<td valign="top">I love the bands of color running horizontally across the frame (the greens, yellows, and blues). The solitary tree without its leaves is a great addition to the composition.</td>', 'I love the bands of color running horizontally across the frame (the greens, yellows, and blues). The solitary tree without its leaves is a great addition to the composition.', '2006-08-09 23:43:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2713291, 315720, 39850, '<td valign="top">I like the focal areas in this.  Overall looks a little dark, but could be my monitor or intentional.  Perhaps a variation in background color may have ''lifted'' this a little and given it more of an edge.  I only voted - 30% or so in this Challenge and didn''t get to this.  Hypothetically, perhaps a 4 or 5, for the reasons given above, plus would like to have seen more ''yellow'' dominate, for the Challenge - just my opinion.</td>', 'I like the focal areas in this.  Overall looks a little dark, but could be my monitor or intentional.  Perhaps a variation in background color may have ''lifted'' this a little and given it more of an edge.  I only voted - 30% or so in this Challenge and didn''t get to this.  Hypothetically, perhaps a 4 or 5, for the reasons given above, plus would like to have seen more ''yellow'' dominate, for the Challenge - just my opinion.', '2006-08-10 00:56:09.000000', NULL, 0),
