(2923767, 313446, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very nicely cropped - I think the negative space on the left works very well here.  Beautiful soft yellows.  The composition of the shot has a very pleasing artistic feel (all of your work does!).  I like the texture in the background but I think it would look nice a wee bit darker (and I think the lines could have been cloned out cleanly).  Your model is great.  His expression is interesting...can''t quite tell what he is thinking about...sort of a Mona Lisa thing!  Maybe a little more warm golden light on his face?  I do not understand why this shot did not score significantly better!  Maybe voters were unforgiving of the lines in the background?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-12 20:16:18.</i></td>', 'Very nicely cropped - I think the negative space on the left works very well here.  Beautiful soft yellows.  The composition of the shot has a very pleasing artistic feel (all of your work does!).  I like the texture in the background but I think it would look nice a wee bit darker (and I think the lines could have been cloned out cleanly).  Your model is great.  His expression is interesting...can''t quite tell what he is thinking about...sort of a Mona Lisa thing!  Maybe a little more warm golden light on his face?  I do not understand why this shot did not score significantly better!  Maybe voters were unforgiving of the lines in the background?', '2006-10-12 21:02:26.000000', '2006-10-12 21:16:18.000000', 0),
